ext: he\n span1_text: Joe\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct choice. ","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Yes\n\n\\boxed{A}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":99,"output_tokens":8}},"cost":1.767e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_671","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nIn the history of Chinese badminton team playing in the finals, no one has ever won the champions of two pair games at the same time.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"在中国羽毛球队参加决赛的历史上，从来没有人同时赢得两项双打比赛的冠军。\n\nThe English sentence is somewhat awkward and appears to have been written by a non-native speaker, so the translation prioritizes natural, idiomatic Chinese while preserving the original meaning. Key renderings include:\n- “In the history of … playing in the finals” → “在中国羽毛球队参加决赛的历史上”\n- “no one has ever” → “从来没有人”\n- “won the champions of two pair games” → “同时赢得两项双打比赛的冠军” (where “pair games” is rendered as the standard badminton term “双打比赛”).\n\nThe result is a fluent, concise Chinese sentence that conveys the intended sense without adding or omitting information.\n\n\\boxed{在中国羽毛球队参加决赛的历史上，从来没有人同时赢得两项双打比赛的冠军。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":178,"output_tokens":180},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001256,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_798","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nIt will not appear.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Tai nepasirodys.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Tai nepasirodys.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":35,"output_tokens":21}},"cost":1.715e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_882","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nGlint secured $10 million in November from Bessemer Venture Partners, bringing its total funding to $60 million.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Glint získal v listopadu 10 milionů dolarů od Bessemer Venture Partners, čímž se jeho celkové financování dostalo na 60 milionů dolarů.\n\n\\boxed{Glint získal v listopadu 10M USD od Bessemer Venture Partners, čímž jeho celkové financování dosáhlo 60M USD.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":175,"output_tokens":78},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":7.4e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_735","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nConvercent has nearly 600 clients, including Airbnb, Microsoft, and Tesla.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is a straightforward factual statement about a company and its clients. Proper names such as “Convercent,” “Airbnb,” “Microsoft,” and “Tesla” remain unchanged.  \n\n- “Has” is rendered by the third-person singular form “má.”  \n- “Nearly” is expressed by the adverb “téměř.”  \n- “600 clients” becomes “600 klientů” (genitive plural after a numeral).  \n- “Including” is translated by the preposition “včetně,” which governs the genitive; the listed company names therefore appear in that case (Microsoftu, Tesly), while the indeclinable “Airbnb” stays unchanged.  \n\nCombining these elements yields the natural Czech sentence  \n\nConvercent má téměř 600 klientů, včetně Airbnb, Microsoftu a Tesly.\n\n\\boxed{Convercent má téměř 600 klientů, včetně Airbnb, Microsoftu a Tesly.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":169,"output_tokens":204},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001358,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_668","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nThe creature was found by Shawn Funk, when he was digging at the Millenium Mine near Fort McMurray in northern Alberta, Canada, on March 21, 2011.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Olennon löysi Shawn Funk, kun hän oli kaivamassa Millenium-kylän kaivoksessa Fort McMurrayssa pohjoisessa Albertassa Kanadassa 21. maaliskuuta 2011.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":68,"output_tokens":59}},"cost":4.4239999999999997e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_483","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nSpeaking of the features of the Jio Phone 2, you get a big key board, 4G support, 2.4 inch display, 2000 mAh battery, 512 MB RAM and 4GB storage, which can be expanded to up to 128 GB.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"જિયો ફોન 2 ની સુવિધાઓની વાત કરીએ તો, તમને મોટું કીબોર્ડ, 4G સપોર્ટ, 2.4 ઇંચની ડિસ્પ્લે, 2000 mAh બેટરી, 512 MB RAM અને 4GB સ્ટોરેજ મળે છે, જેને 128 GB સુધી વિસ્તરિત કરી શકાય છે.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{જિયો ફોન 2 ની સુવિધાઓની વાત કરીએ તો, તમને મોટું કીબોર્ડ, 4G સપોર્ટ, 2.4 ઇંચની ડિસ્પ્લે, 2000 mAh બેટરી, 512 MB RAM અને 4GB સ્ટોરેજ મળે છે, જેને 128 GB સુધી વિસ્તરિત કરી શકાય છે.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":94,"output_tokens":470}},"cost":0.00029422000000000004,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_614","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAccording to information from the Bavarian Surveying and Mapping Authority, these came into being between 1810 and 1864 and arise out of the first survey of Bavaria.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Laut Angaben der bayerischen Vermessungs- und Katasterverwaltung entstanden diese zwischen 1810 und 1864 und gehen auf die erste Vermessung Bayerns zurück.\n\n\\boxed{Laut Angaben der bayerischen Vermessungs- und Katasterverwaltung entstanden diese zwischen 1810 und 1864 und gehen auf die erste Vermessung Bayerns zurück.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":68,"output_tokens":95}},"cost":6.584e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_52","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nOnePlus 6T will be launched next month on 17th October.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence to be translated is “OnePlus 6T will be launched next month on 17th October.”\n\n- Proper nouns and model names such as “OnePlus 6T” and the month “October” are normally left in their original Latin script or rendered by straightforward transliteration; the conventional Gujarati spellings are વનપ્લસ 6T and ઓક્ટોબર.\n- The future passive construction “will be launched” is idiomatically rendered in Gujarati technology contexts as લોન્ચ થશે.\n- The temporal phrase “next month on 17th October” becomes આવતા મહિને 17મી ઓક્ટોબરે.\n\nCombining these elements yields the natural Gujarati sentence  \nવનપ્લસ 6T આવતા મહિને 17મી ઓક્ટોબરે લોન્ચ થશે.\n\n\\boxed{વનપ્લસ 6T આવતા મહિને 17મી ઓક્ટોબરે લોન્ચ થશે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":168,"output_tokens":250},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001586,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_781","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nNew York was joined in the case by California, Connecticut, Delaware, Illinois, Iowa, Maine, Massachusetts, Minnesota, New Mexico, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, Vermont and Washington, and the District of Columbia.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"K případu se připojily New York, Kalifornie, Connecticut, Delaware, Illinois, Iowa, Maine, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Nové Mexiko, Oregon, Pensylvánie, Rhode Island, Vermont a Washington a také okres Columbia.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{K případu se připojily New York, Kalifornie, Connecticut, Delaware, Illinois, Iowa, Maine, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Nové Mexiko, Oregon, Pensylvánie, Rhode Island, Vermont a Washington a také okres Columbia.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":74,"output_tokens":118}},"cost":8.042e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-kk-en_438","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Kazakh.\n\nApproximately 500,000 citizens of ASEAN member states now live and work in Korea, while roughly 300,000 Koreans live and work in ASEAN countries.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Шамамен 500 000 АСЕАН мүше мемлекеттерінің азаматтары қазір Кореяда тұрып, жұмыс істейді, ал шамамен 300 000 корейлік АСЕАН елдерінде тұрып, жұмыс істейді.\n\n\\boxed{Шамамен 500 000 АСЕАН мүше мемлекеттерінің азаматтары қазір Кореяда тұрып, жұмыс істейді, ал шамамен 300 000 корейлік АСЕАН елдерінде тұрып, жұмыс істейді.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":181,"output_tokens":135},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001037,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_149","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nPossible indoor climate problems investigated in Säkylä\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence appears to be a headline or title fragment, so the Finnish rendering should preserve a similarly concise, title-like structure while using standard terminology. In Finnish building/health contexts, “indoor climate problems” is conventionally rendered as the compound “sisäilmasto-ongelmat” (or the slightly shorter “sisäilmaongelmat”).  \n\n“Possible” becomes the adjective “mahdollisia” (partitive plural to agree with the following noun).  \n“Investigated in Säkylä” is expressed by the past participle “tutkittuja” followed by the inessive place-name “Säkylässä,” yielding the compact headline-style phrase  \n\nSäkylässä tutkittuja mahdollisia sisäilmasto-ongelmia.\n\nThis keeps the original word order, maintains natural Finnish compounding, and respects the title register of the source.\n\n\\boxed{Säkylässä tutkittuja mahdollisia sisäilmasto-ongelmia}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":161,"output_tokens":200},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.00013220000000000001,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_721","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nSerena Williams sings 'I Touch Myself' topless to raise breast cancer awareness\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is:  \n“Serena Williams sings ‘I Touch Myself’ topless to raise breast cancer awareness.”\n\nKey elements and their Gujarati renderings are:  \n- Proper name “Serena Williams” remains unchanged.  \n- “sings” → ગાય છે.  \n- Song title “I Touch Myself” is transliterated as આઇ ટચ માયસેલ્ફ (kept in quotation marks).  \n- “topless” → ટોપલેસ (commonly understood loan-word).  \n- “to raise … awareness” → જાગૃતિ વધારવા માટે.  \n- “breast cancer” → સ્તન કેન્સર.\n\nThese fragments are assembled into a single, grammatically natural Gujarati sentence while preserving the original meaning and word order as closely as possible:\n\nસેરેના વિલિયમ્સ સ્તન કેન્સરની જાગૃતિ વધારવા માટે ટોપલેસ “આઇ ટચ માયસેલ્ફ” ગાય છે.\n\n\\boxed{સેરેના વિલિયમ્સ સ્તન કેન્સરની જાગૃતિ વધારવા માટે ટોપલેસ “આઇ ટચ માયસેલ્ફ” ગાય છે}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":169,"output_tokens":328},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001978,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_575","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nJavanese warung canteens sell fried chicken and gado-gado mixed-vegetables served with peanut sauce.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Javanische Warung-Kantinen verkaufen gebratenes Huhn und Gado-Gado, ein Gemüsegericht, das mit Erdnusssoße serviert wird.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":53,"output_tokens":46}},"cost":3.449e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_287","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nWhite or brown: what kind of sugar is recommended by the nutritionist\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Baltas ar rudas: kurį cukraus tipą rekomenduoja mitybos specialistas\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Baltas ar rudas: kurį cukraus tipą rekomenduoja mitybos specialistas}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":45,"output_tokens":56}},"cost":3.9450000000000003e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_892","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nHogan's staff has blocked and deleted the posts of at least 450 people who voiced their opinions on his official Facebook page.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Hogans Mitarbeiter haben die Beiträge von mindestens 450 Personen blockiert und gelöscht, die ihre Meinungen auf seiner offiziellen Facebook-Seite geäußert haben.\n\nThe source sentence is rendered into natural, idiomatic German while preserving every semantic element and the original syntactic relations.  \n- “Hogan’s staff” becomes the concise and commonly used “Hogans Mitarbeiter.”  \n- The perfect-tense verb phrase “has blocked and deleted” is translated directly as “haben … blockiert und gelöscht,” with the auxiliary placed according to German word-order rules.  \n- “Posts” is rendered as “Beiträge,” the standard term on German-language Facebook.  \n- The quantifier “at least 450 people” is kept verbatim as “mindestens 450 Personen.”  \n- The relative clause “who voiced their opinions …” is attached to “Personen” with the subjunctive-free indicative “die ihre Meinungen … geäußert haben,” maintaining the participial meaning.  \n- “Official Facebook page” is translated literally as “offiziellen Facebook-Seite,” the conventional collocation.  \n\nThe resulting sentence is grammatically correct, stylistically neutral, and fully faithful to the English original.\n\n\\boxed{Hogans Mitarb. haben die Beiträge von ≥450 Pers. blockiert u. gelöscht, die ihre Meinungen auf seiner off. FB-Seite geäußert haben.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":176,"output_tokens":306},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.00018820000000000002,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_402","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nThe most popular cloud services, such as Amazon AWS, Microsoft Azure and Alibaba Cloud, offer MariaDB to their customers.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Suosituimmat pilvipalvelut, kuten Amazon AWS, Microsoft Azure ja Alibaba Cloud, tarjoavat MariaDB:n asiakkailleen.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":61,"output_tokens":31}},"cost":2.653e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_590","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nAs well as lumps, other signs of breast cancer include a change in breast size or shape, a rash or skin sores, nipple discharge, skin indentation, constant pain or a change in skin texture.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence describes additional symptoms of breast cancer beyond lumps, using standard medical terminology. A direct, accurate translation into Gujarati (using the Gujarati script) is therefore:\n\nગઠ્ઠાં ઉપરાંત, સ્તન કેન્સરના અન્ય સંકેતોમાં સ્તનના કદ અથવા આકારમાં ફેરફાર, ફોલ્લી અથવા ત્વચાના ઘા, નિપલમાંથી સ્રાવ, ત્વચામાં ખાડો પડવો, સતત દુખાવો અથવા ત્વચાની રચનામાં ફેરફારનો સમાવેશ થાય છે.\n\nThis rendering preserves the original sentence structure, correctly renders each clinical term (e.g., “lumps” → ગઠ્ઠાં, “nipple discharge” → નિપલમાંથી સ્રાવ, “skin indentation” → ત્વચામાં ખાડો પડવો), and employs natural Gujarati phrasing for medical contexts.\n\n\\boxed{ગઠ્ઠાં ઉપરાંત, સ્તન કેન્સરના અન્ય સંકેતોમાં સ્તનના કદ અથવા આકારમાં ફેરફાર, ફોલ્લી અથવા ત્વચાના ઘા, નિપલમાંથી સ્રાવ, ત્વચામાં ખાડો પડવો, સતત દુખાવો અથવા ત્વચાની રચનામાં ફેરફારનો સમાવેશ થાય છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":192,"output_tokens":437},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002569,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_601","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nGoing to buy new ones\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{\\text{Einu pirkti naujų}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":36,"output_tokens":15}},"cost":1.3680000000000001e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_301","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAccording to that information, ten million people with foreign nationality are recorded in the register, among whom around 5.7 million from non-EU states.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence is translated literally while preserving its formal register and structure.  \n- “According to that information” becomes the natural German connective “Diesen Informationen zufolge”.  \n- “Ten million people with foreign nationality are recorded in the register” is rendered as “sind … zehn Millionen Menschen mit ausländischer Staatsangehörigkeit im Register erfasst”, keeping the passive construction and the precise administrative term “Staatsangehörigkeit”.  \n- “Among whom around 5.7 million from non-EU states” is expressed by the concise apposition “darunter etwa 5,7 Millionen aus Nicht-EU-Staaten”, using the conventional German decimal comma and the established abbreviation “Nicht-EU”.  \n\nThe resulting German sentence is therefore:  \nDiesen Informationen zufolge sind im Register zehn Millionen Menschen mit ausländischer Staatsangehörigkeit erfasst, darunter etwa 5,7 Millionen aus Nicht-EU-Staaten.\n\n\\boxed{Diesen Informationen zufolge sind im Register 10 Mio. Menschen mit ausländ. Staatsangehörigkeit erfasst, darunter ca. 5,7 Mio. aus Nicht-EU-Staaten.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":180,"output_tokens":239},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001555,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_645","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nThe tennis star won six major singles titles, 13 Masters Series titles and an Olympic gold medal in doubles.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"ટેનિસ તારાએ છ મુખ્ય સિંગલ્સ ટાઇટલ, 13 માસ્ટર્સ સિરીઝ ટાઇટલ અને ડબલ્સમાં એક ઓલિમ્પિક સુવર્ણ પદક જીત્યો હતો.\n\n\\boxed{{ટેનિસ તારાએ છ મુખ્ય સિંગલ્સ ટાઇટલ, 13 માસ્ટર્સ સિરીઝ ટાઇટલ અને ડબલ્સમાં એક ઓલિમ્પિક સુવર્ણ પદક જીત્યો હતો.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":52,"output_tokens":322}},"cost":0.00019995999999999998,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_731","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nThe 110-million-year-old creature, part of the nodosaur family, first hit headlines in May and is now on view at the Royal Tyrrell Museum of Palaeontology.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{110 miljoonaa vuotta vanha olento, joka kuuluu nodosaurheimoonsa, sai ensimmäistä kertaa otsikkoja toukokuussa ja on nyt nähtävillä Royal Tyrrellin paleontologian museossa.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":66,"output_tokens":71}},"cost":5.118e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_195","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nThe first China International Import Expo will be held in Shanghai from November 5th-10th, 2018.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{首届中国国际进口博览会将于2018年11月5日至10日在上海举行。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":55,"output_tokens":26}},"cost":2.275e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_884","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nAt the age of 12, Prithvi had scored 546 runs in the Harris Shield match and became popular.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"૧૨ વર્ષની ઉંમરે, પૃથ્વીએ હેરિસ શિલ્ડ મેચમાં ૫૪૬ રન બનાવ્યા હતા અને લોકપ્રિય બન્યો હતો.\n\n\\boxed{૧૨ વર્ષની ઉંમરે, પૃથ્વીએ હેરિસ શિલ્ડ મેચમાં ૫૪૬ રન બનાવ્યા હતા અને લોકપ્રિય બન્યો હતો.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":56,"output_tokens":265}},"cost":0.00016628,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_883","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nIn 2003, the province was officially split into Papua and West Papua, with independent Papua New Guinea occupying the eastern part of the island.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"V roce 2003 byla provincie oficiálně rozdělena na Papua a Západní Papua, přičemž nezávislá Papua-Nová Guinea obsadila východní část ostrova.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{V roce 2003 byla provincie oficiálně rozdělena na Papua a Západní Papua, přičemž nezávislá Papua-Nová Guinea obsadila východní část ostrova.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":61,"output_tokens":114}},"cost":7.633e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_843","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe sculptor Bildhauer Bjørn Nørgaard is already crafting a sarcophagus for the two of them.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Der Bildhauer Bjørn Nørgaard fertigt bereits einen Sarkophag für die beiden an.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":55,"output_tokens":29}},"cost":2.455e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_310","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nAccording to foreign media reports, renowned Hollywood director Garry Marshall passed away on July 19 local time of complications from pneumonia at a hospital in Burbank, California. He was 81 years old.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"据外媒报道，好莱坞著名导演加里·马歇尔于当地时间7月19日因肺炎并发症在加利福尼亚州伯班克的一家医院逝世，享年81岁。\n\n\\boxed{据外媒报道，好莱坞著名导演加里·马歇尔于当地时间7月19日因肺炎并发症在加利福尼亚州伯班克的一家医院逝世，享年81岁。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":189,"output_tokens":96},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":8.58e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_117","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThere were only 471 pandas living in captivity at the end of last year.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence translates naturally into Czech as follows:\n\n- “There were only 471 pandas” becomes “žilo … pouze 471 pand” (the verb is placed in the neuter singular to agree with the existential construction, and the noun appears in the genitive plural after the numeral).  \n- “living in captivity” is rendered by the prepositional phrase “v zajetí”.  \n- “at the end of last year” is expressed by the temporal adverbial “na konci minulého roku” (or the slightly more concise “koncem loňského roku”).\n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent Czech sentence  \n“Na konci minulého roku žilo v zajetí pouze 471 pand.”\n\n\\boxed{Na konci minulého roku žilo v zajetí pouze 471 pand.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":168,"output_tokens":170},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001186,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_170","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nIn the history of the Grammy Awards, Beyoncé and Adele are the two female singers who have won the most Grammy Awards in a single year.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"在格莱美奖的历史上，碧昂丝和阿黛尔是在单一年份中获得最多格莱美奖的两位女歌手。\n\n\\boxed{在格莱美奖史上，碧昂丝和阿黛尔是在单一年份赢得最多格莱美奖的两位女歌手。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":179,"output_tokens":64},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":6.78e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_159","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe Fischerbach pasture fence project is a successful project and will be continued next year.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Das Weidezaunprojekt Fischerbach ist ein erfolgreiches Projekt und wird nächstes Jahr fortgesetzt.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":45,"output_tokens":29}},"cost":2.325e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_343","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nApple has launched Apple Watch Series 4 on Wednesday.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence to be translated is “Apple has launched Apple Watch Series 4 on Wednesday.”\n\n- Retain the proper nouns “Apple” and “Apple Watch Series 4” as transliterations, which is conventional in Gujarati technical contexts: એપલ and એપલ વોચ સિરીઝ 4.  \n- Render the verb phrase “has launched” with the common Gujarati construction લોન્ચ કર્યું છે (neutral gender, matching standard usage for product releases).  \n- Translate the temporal phrase “on Wednesday” as બુધવારે.  \n\nCombining these elements yields the grammatically natural Gujarati sentence  \nએપલે બુધવારે એપલ વોચ સિરીઝ 4 લોન્ચ કર્યું છે.\n\n\\boxed{એપલે બુધવારે એપલ વોચ સિરીઝ 4 લોન્ચ કર્યું છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":163,"output_tokens":219},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001421,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-ru-en_98","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Russian.\n\nWorld Championships 2017: Neil Black praises Scottish members of Team GB\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Чемпионат мира 2017: Нил Блэк хвалит шотландских членов команды Великобритании\n\n\\boxed{{Чемпионат мира 2017: Нил Блэк хвалит шотландских членов команды Великобритании}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":45,"output_tokens":76}},"cost":5.1450000000000004e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_458","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nDo you have patients with Alzheimer's in your family?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is \"Do you have patients with Alzheimer's in your family?\"\n\n- \"Do you have\" translates directly as \"Máte\".\n- \"patients with Alzheimer's\" translates as \"pacienty s Alzheimerovou chorobou\" (using the standard Czech medical term for the disease).\n- \"in your family\" translates as \"ve své rodině\" (the reflexive \"své\" is the natural choice in Czech for \"your\" in this context).\n\nCombining these elements produces the full, grammatically correct Czech sentence \"Máte ve své rodině pacienty s Alzheimerovou chorobou?\"\n\n\\boxed{Máte ve své rodině pacienty s Alzheimerovou chorobou?}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":162,"output_tokens":147},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001059,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_137","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nCERN organization is best known for its Large Hadron Collider (LHC), the world’s largest and most powerful particle accelerator located in Switzerland.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{CERN organizacija labiausiai žinoma dėl savo Didžiojo hadronų greitintuvo (DHG), didžiausio ir galingiausio pasaulyje dalelių greitintuvo, esančio Šveicarijoje.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":59,"output_tokens":72}},"cost":5.086999999999999e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_82","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nMorton 1 - 5 Ayr United: Five star Ayr hammer hosts\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The given text is a sports headline reporting a football result, where the scoreline is followed by a descriptive phrase indicating a dominant victory by the away side. Team names are transliterated directly into Gujarati script while preserving their original form (મોર્ટન and એર યુનાઈટેડ).  \n\nThe English phrase “Five star Ayr hammer hosts” is rendered idiomatically:  \n- “Five star” becomes “ફાઇવ સ્ટાર” (retaining the common sports-colloquial sense of an outstanding performance).  \n- “Hammer” is translated by the conventional Gujarati sports expression “કચડી નાખ્યા,” which conveys a heavy defeat.  \n- “Hosts” is rendered as “યજમાનો,” the standard term for the home team.  \n\nCombining these elements produces the natural Gujarati headline  \nમોર્ટન 1 - 5 એર યુનાઈટેડ: ફાઇવ સ્ટાર એરે યજમાનોને કચડી નાખ્યા.\n\n\\boxed{મોર્ટન 1-5 એર યુનાઈટેડ: ફાઇવ સ્ટાર એરે યજમાનોને કચડી નાખ્યા}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":168,"output_tokens":298},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001826,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_755","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nSarah Palin's oldest son charged with beating up his father\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence is a news headline, so the Lithuanian rendering must preserve a concise, headline-style structure while remaining grammatically natural.  \n\n- “Sarah Palin” remains unchanged as a proper name.  \n- “oldest son” translates directly as “vyriausias sūnus.”  \n- “charged with” is rendered by the headline-appropriate passive participle “kaltinamas.”  \n- “beating up” is nominalized to the concise noun “tėvo sumušimu” (instrumental case), which is the conventional way Lithuanian headlines express the charge.  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the compact, idiomatic headline  \n\nSarah Palin vyriausias sūnus kaltinamas tėvo sumušimu.\n\n\\boxed{Sarah Palin vyriausias sūnus kaltinamas tėvo sumušimu}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":162,"output_tokens":164},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001144,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_513","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nSelf-Publishing 1.0 was desktop publishing and print on demand.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"સ્વ-પ્રકાશન 1.0 ડેસ્કટૉપ પ્રકાશન અને માંગ મુજબ છાપવાનું હતું.\n\n\\boxed{{સ્વ-પ્રકાશન 1.0 ડેસ્કટૉપ પ્રકાશન અને માંગ મુજબ છાપવાનું હતું.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":45,"output_tokens":183}},"cost":0.00011565,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_375","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nSalvador Adame disappeared in the western state of Michoacan three days after Valdez was killed.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Salvador Adame katosi Michoacánin läntisestä osavaltiosta kolme päivää sen jälkeen, kun Valdez tapettiin.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":51,"output_tokens":46}},"cost":3.4229999999999996e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_848","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nAlthough the MH 370 aircraft from Malaysia has been missing for more than 50 days, we haven't received any news about its whereabouts.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence to be translated is a concessive clause (using \"although\") followed by the main clause. The key terms map to Gujarati as follows:\n\n- \"Although\" → \"છતાં પણ\" / \"તેમ છતાં\"\n- \"MH 370 aircraft from Malaysia\" → \"મલેશિયાનું MH 370 વિમાન\"\n- \"has been missing for more than 50 days\" → \"50 દિવસથી વધુ સમયથી ગુમ છે\"\n- \"we haven't received any news\" → \"અમને કોઈ સમાચાર મળ્યા નથી\"\n- \"about its whereabouts\" → \"તેના ઠેકાણા વિશે\"\n\nCombining these elements while preserving natural Gujarati word order and the concessive sense yields the translation below.\n\n\\boxed{મલેશિયાનું MH 370 વિમાન 50 દિવસથી વધુ સમયથી ગુમ છે તેમ છતાં અમને તેના ઠેકાણા વિશે કોઈ સમાચાર મળ્યા નથી.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":179,"output_tokens":273},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001723,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_469","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nMichelle Carter sentenced for texts urging suicide of Conrad Roy\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Michelle Carter wurde wegen Textnachrichten, die zum Suizid von Conrad Roy anstachelten, verurteilt.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":39,"output_tokens":33}},"cost":2.487e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_377","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nKendrick Lamar leak: Eight unheard songs surface online\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is the English headline “Kendrick Lamar leak: Eight unheard songs surface online.”  \n\n- Proper names such as “Kendrick Lamar” are left unchanged.  \n- “Leak” is rendered by the commonly borrowed Gujarati term “લીક.”  \n- “Eight unheard songs” becomes “આઠ અજાણ્યા ગીતો,” where “અજાણ્યા” conveys the sense of previously unheard material.  \n- “Surface online” is expressed by the natural headline-style phrase “ઓનલાઈન સામે આવ્યા.”  \n\nCombining these elements yields the concise, idiomatic Gujarati headline  \n\nકેન્ડ્રિક લામાર લીક: આઠ અજાણ્યા ગીતો ઓનલાઈન સામે આવ્યા  \n\n\\boxed{કેન્ડ્રિક લામાર લીક: આઠ અજાણ્યા ગીતો ઓનલાઈન સામે આવ્યા}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":163,"output_tokens":238},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001516,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_435","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nAir India employees usually get salaries on the 30th and the 31st of every month.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"એર ઇન્ડિયાના કર્મચારીઓને સામાન્ય રીતે દર મહિનાની 30 અને 31 તારીખે પગાર મળે છે.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{એર ઇન્ડિયાના કર્મચારીઓને સામાન્ય રીતે દર મહિનાની 30 અને 31 તારીખે પગાર મળે છે.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":51,"output_tokens":235}},"cost":0.00014763000000000002,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_36","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nApart from this, he also has a Mahindra Scorpio of 10 lakhs, Royal Enfield classic 350 of 1.50 lakhs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"આ ઉપરાંત, તેની પાસે 10 લાખની મહિંદ્રા સ્કોર્પિયો અને 1.50 લાખની રૉયલ એનફિલ્ડ ક્લાસિક 350 પણ છે.\n\n\\boxed{આ ઉપરાંત, તેની પાસે 10 લાખની મહિંદ્રા સ્કોર્પિયો અને 1.50 લાખની રૉયલ એનફિલ્ડ ક્લાસિક 350 પણ છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":66,"output_tokens":283}},"cost":0.00017837999999999998,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_272","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nShe referred to Mr Lyle as Shaquelle's \"boyfriend.\"\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence uses the construction “referred to X as Y,” which in Gujarati is most naturally rendered with the verb phrase “ઉલ્લેખ કર્યો” (or the slightly more formal “ઓળખાવ્યા”) together with the postposition “તરીકે.”  \n\n- “She” → તેણી  \n- “Mr Lyle” → મિ. લાઈલ (proper name left unchanged)  \n- “Shaquelle’s” → શેક્વેલના (transliterated possessive)  \n- “boyfriend” (quoted term) → ‘બોયફ્રેન્ડ’ (kept in quotes and transliterated)  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent Gujarati sentence  \n\nતેણીએ મિ. લાઈલને શેક્વેલના ‘બોયફ્રેન્ડ’ તરીકે ઉલ્લેખ કર્યો.  \n\n(The past-tense marker “હતો” may be added for explicit perfective aspect, but it is optional in this context and does not alter the meaning.)\n\n\\boxed{તેણીએ મિ. લાઈલને શેક્વેલના 'બોયફ્રેન્ડ' તરીકે ઉલ્લેખ કર્યો.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":165,"output_tokens":306},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.000186,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_702","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nIt has been known to infect doves, particularly pigeons.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Tiedetään, että se on tartuttanut kyyhkyisiä, erityisesti kotipaljokkia.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Tiedetään, että se on tartuttanut kyyhkyisiä, erityisesti kotipaljokkia.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":41,"output_tokens":66}},"cost":4.493e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_294","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThis long tail of Antarctica stretches towards South America.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Dieser lange Schweif der Antarktis erstreckt sich nach Südamerika.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":38,"output_tokens":24}},"cost":1.934e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_799","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nBy the year 2023, in those 349 launched models of electric cars, 50% will be SUV cars.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence projects a future state regarding electric-car models. Rendering it into Gujarati requires preserving the temporal phrase, the numeric reference, and the proportional prediction while employing natural Gujarati syntax and common transliterations for technical terms.\n\n- “By the year 2023” becomes “2023ના વર્ષ સુધીમાં”.  \n- “those 349 launched models of electric cars” is expressed as “લોન્ચ કરેલા ઇલેક્ટ્રિક કારના 349 મોડલ્સ”.  \n- “50 % will be SUV cars” is rendered “50 % SUV કાર હશે”.\n\nConcatenating these segments yields the fluent Gujarati sentence  \n“2023ના વર્ષ સુધીમાં, લોન્ચ કરેલા ઇલેક્ટ્રિક કારના 349 મોડલ્સમાંથી 50 % SUV કાર હશે.”\n\n\\boxed{2023ના વર્ષ સુધીમાં, લોન્ચ કરેલા ઇલેક્ટ્રિક કારના 349 મોડલ્સમાંથી 50% SUV કાર હશે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":177,"output_tokens":285},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001779,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_607","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nKnights duel with swords during a medieval combat festival at Claregalway castle in Galway, Ireland September 29, 2018.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Riteriai kovojo su kardais viduramžių kovos šventėje Klairo galio pilyje, Galvejus, Airijoje, 2018 m. rugsėjo 29 d.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Riteriai kovojo su kardais viduramžių kovos šventėje Klairo galio pilyje, Galvejus, Airijoje, 2018 m. rugsėjo 29 d.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":61,"output_tokens":119}},"cost":7.932999999999999e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_917","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAccording to rights activists, more than 500,000 Papuans have been killed, and thousands more have been raped, tortured and imprisoned by the Indonesian military since 1969.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Nach Angaben von Menschenrechtsaktivisten wurden seit 1969 mehr als 500.000 Papuas getötet, und Tausende wurden von der indonesischen Armee vergewaltigt, gefoltert und inhaftiert.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":71,"output_tokens":64}},"cost":4.7629999999999996e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_310","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nSwiss introduced the possibility of inserting a logo two and a half years ago, at the start of the collaboration with Chocolat Frey.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is:  \n“Swiss introduced the possibility of inserting a logo two and a half years ago, at the start of the collaboration with Chocolat Frey.”\n\nA direct, idiomatic rendering into German proceeds as follows:\n\n- “Swiss” is retained as the proper name of the airline.  \n- “introduced … the possibility” becomes the separable verb construction “führte … die Möglichkeit ein”.  \n- “of inserting a logo” is rendered by the infinitive phrase “ein Logo einzufügen”.  \n- The temporal adverbial “two and a half years ago” is expressed by the standard German phrase “vor zweieinhalb Jahren”.  \n- The prepositional phrase “at the start of the collaboration with Chocolat Frey” is translated literally as “zu Beginn der Zusammenarbeit mit Chocolat Frey”.\n\nReordering the constituents for natural German word order yields the compact sentence  \n\nSwiss führte die Möglichkeit, ein Logo einzufügen, vor zweieinhalb Jahren ein, zu Beginn der Zusammenarbeit mit Chocolat Frey.\n\nThis version preserves the original meaning, maintains grammatical correctness, and reads fluently in German.\n\n\\boxed{Swiss führte die Möglichkeit, ein Logo einzufügen, vor zweieinhalb Jahren ein, zu Beginn der Zusammenarbeit mit Chocolat Frey.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":177,"output_tokens":270},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001704,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_656","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nFifteen-year-old Cao Cao was released into a nature reserve at the beginning of the panda mating season on 11 March.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Patnáctiletý Cao Cao byl propuštěn do přírodní rezervace na začátku pářicí sezóny pand dne 11. března.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":59,"output_tokens":56}},"cost":4.127e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_555","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nLathem has been an associate professor of microbiology and immunology at Northwestern University since 2007.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Lathem ist seit 2007 außerordentlicher Professor für Mikrobiologie und Immunologie an der Northwestern University.\n\n\\boxed{Lathem\\ ist\\ seit\\ 2007\\ außerordentlicher\\ Professor\\ für\\ Mikrobiologie\\ und\\ Immunologie\\ an\\ der\\ Northwestern\\ University.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":52,"output_tokens":76}},"cost":5.236000000000001e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_389","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nUkraine hosts three Orthodox Churches, yet only one of them - the Ukrainian Orthodox Church of the Moscow Patriarchate - is recognized by other Churches.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"યુક્રેનમાં ત્રણ ઓર્થોડોક્સ ચર્ચો છે, છતાં તેમાંથી માત્ર એક જ—મોસ્કો પેટ્રિઆર્કેટનું યુક્રેનિયન ઓર્થોડોક્સ ચર્ચ—અન્ય ચર્ચો દ્વારા માન્યતા પ્રાપ્ત છે.\n\n\\boxed{યુક્રેનમાં ત્રણ ઓર્થોડોક્સ ચર્ચો છે, છતાં તેમાંથી માત્ર એક જ—મોસ્કો પેટ્રિઆર્કેટનું યુક્રેનિયન ઓર્થોડોક્સ ચર્ચ—અન્ય ચર્ચો દ્વારા માન્યતા પ્રાપ્ત છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":180,"output_tokens":247},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001595,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_765","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nAt hitting the 24th century, Virat Kohli overtook Australia's Greg Chappell, Pakistan's Mohammad Yousuf and West Indies legend Sir Viv Richards.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"24મી સદી પૂર્ણ કરતાં, વિરાટ કોહલીએ ઓસ્ટ્રેલિયાના ગ્રેગ ચેપેલ, પાકિસ્તાનના મોહમ્મદ યુસુફ અને વેસ્ટ ઈન્ડીઝના દંતકથા સર વિવ્ રિચર્ડ્સને પાછળ છોડી દીધા.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{24મી સદી પૂર્ણ કરતાં, વિરાટ કોહલીએ ઓસ્ટ્રેલિયાના ગ્રેગ ચેપેલ, પાકિસ્તાનના મોહમ્મદ યુસુફ અને વેસ્ટ ઈન્ડીઝના દંતકથા સર વિવ્ રિચર્ડ્સને પાછળ છોડી દીધા.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":65,"output_tokens":457}},"cost":0.00028265,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_376","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nShonda Rhimes, Jada Pinkett Smith, Gabrielle Union-Wade and Dwyane Wade have joined the producing team of Broadway's American Son.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"શોન્ડા રાઈમ્સ, જાડા પિંકેટ સ્મિથ, ગેબ્રિયેલ યુનિયન-વેડ અને ડ્વેયન વેડે બ્રોડવેના અમેરિકન સનની પ્રોડ્યુસિંગ ટીમમાં જોડાયા છે.\n\nThe sentence is translated by retaining proper names in transliterated form (as is conventional for such references) while rendering the predicate and noun phrases into natural Gujarati. “Have joined” becomes the present-perfect construction જોડાયા છે; “producing team” is kept as the transparent borrowing પ્રોડ્યુસિંગ ટીમ; and the possessive “Broadway’s American Son” is expressed with the genitive બ્રોડવેના … ની. The resulting Gujarati sentence preserves both the factual content and the syntactic structure of the English original.\n\n\\boxed{શોન્ડા રાઈમ્સ, જાડા પિંકેટ સ્મિથ, ગેબ્રિયેલ યુનિયન-વેડ અને ડ્વેયન વેડે બ્રોડવેના અમેરિકન સનની પ્રોડ્યુસિંગ ટીમમાં જોડાયા છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":183,"output_tokens":343},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002081,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_762","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nPerformances will begin Oct. 6, with an official opening night planned for Nov.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated refers to the start of performances (in a theatrical or similar context) on a specific date, along with a planned formal premiere on a later date. \n\nA direct, natural translation into Gujarati that preserves the original meaning, abbreviations, and sentence structure is therefore:  \n“પ્રદર્શનો ૬ ઑક્ટોબરથી શરૂ થશે, જેમાં નવેમ્બર માટે અધિકૃત ઉદ્ઘાટન રાત્રિનું આયોજન કરવામાં આવ્યું છે.”\n\nThis rendering uses the conventional Gujarati terms  \n- પ્રદર્શનો for “performances,”  \n- શરૂ થશે for “will begin,”  \n- અધિકૃત ઉદ્ઘાટન રાત્રિ for “official opening night,” and  \n- આયોજન કરવામાં આવ્યું છે for “planned,”  \nwhile retaining the abbreviated month names and numeric date exactly as they appear in the source.\n\n\\boxed{પ્રદર્શનો ૬ ઑક્ટોબરથી શરૂ થશે, જેમાં નવેમ્બર માટે અધિકૃત ઉદ્ઘાટન રાત્રિનું આયોજન કરવામાં આવ્યું છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":170,"output_tokens":340},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.00020400000000000003,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_224","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nUp until 1869, the Hilarius cemetery in Tumlingen served as the last place of rest for Hörschweiler's dead.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Bis 1869 diente der Hilarius-Friedhof in Tumlingen als letzte Ruhestätte der Verstorbenen aus Hörschweiler.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":60,"output_tokens":43}},"cost":3.3600000000000004e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_515","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nIn addition, Papua boasts timber resources worth an estimated $78 billion.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Außerdem verfügt Papua über Holzressourcen im geschätzten Wert von 78 Milliarden US-Dollar.\n\n\\boxed{Außerdem verfügt Papua über Holzressourcen im geschätzten Wert von 78 Milliarden US-Dollar.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":43,"output_tokens":60}},"cost":4.159e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_268","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nShaquelle Vidal, 23, the daughter of a TV comedian, died on April 7 after spending almost a month as a \"voluntary\" patient at the Nightingale Hospital in Marylebone, West London.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Šekelė Vidhal, 23 metų, televizijos komiko dukra, mirė balandžio 7 d., beveik mėnesį praleidusi kaip „savanorė“ pacientė Naitingėil ligoninėje Merilebone, Vakarų Londone.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Šekelė Vidhal, 23 metų, televizijos komiko dukra, mirė balandžio 7 d., beveik mėnesį praleidusi kaip „savанorė“ pacientė Naitingėil ligoninėje Merilebone, Vakarų Londone.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":77,"output_tokens":159}},"cost":0.00010540999999999998,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_269","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nLook Over Your Shoulders (featuring Busta Rhymes & Michael Jackson)\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{\\text{Atsigręžk per petį (su Busta Rhymes ir Michael Jackson)}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":46,"output_tokens":25}},"cost":2.098e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_484","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nCarter was 17 when Mr Roy was found dead of carbon monoxide poisoning in a vehicle in 2014.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"A natural and accurate Chinese translation that preserves the original sentence structure, names, and details is as follows:\n\n卡特17岁时，罗伊先生于2014年被发现死于车内一氧化碳中毒。\n\nThis rendering correctly handles:\n- The subject and age clause (“Carter was 17” → “卡特17岁时”).\n- The subordinate clause with passive voice (“Mr Roy was found dead” → “罗伊先生被发现死于”).\n- The cause of death (“carbon monoxide poisoning” → “一氧化碳中毒”).\n- The location (“in a vehicle” → “车内”).\n- The time reference (“in 2014” → “于2014年”).\n\nAlternative word orders are possible in Chinese, but the version above stays closest to the English syntax while remaining idiomatic.\n\n\\boxed{卡特17岁时，罗伊先生于2014年被发现死于车内一氧化碳中毒。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":172,"output_tokens":199},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001339,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_191","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nIts price in Chennai will be Rs. 484.67 and Rs. 770.50, respectively.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated refers to a price (or set of prices) that will apply in the city of Chennai. The core elements are therefore:\n\n- “Its price” → તેની કિંમત  \n- “in Chennai” → ચેન્નાઈમાં  \n- “will be” → હશે  \n- “respectively” → અનુક્રમે (placed immediately before the two amounts)  \n- Currency amounts remain unchanged; the abbreviation “Rs.” is conventionally rendered as રૂ. in Gujarati script.\n\nCombining these elements while preserving natural Gujarati word order yields the translation  \n\nચેન્નાઈમાં તેની કિંમત અનુક્રમે રૂ. 484.67 અને રૂ. 770.50 હશે.\n\n\\boxed{ચેન્નાઈમાં તેની કિંમત અનુક્રમે રૂ. 484.67 અને રૂ. 770.50 હશે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":174,"output_tokens":231},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001503,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_226","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nThe Alliance of Independent Authors is the only global, non-profit association for self-publishing writers.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"સ્વ-પ્રકાશન લેખકો માટે આલયન્સ ઓફ ઇન્ડિપેન્ડન્ટ ઓથર્સ એ એકમાત્ર વૈશ્વિક, ગેરનફા સંસ્થા છે. \\boxed{{સ્વ-પ્રકાશન લેખકો માટે આલયન્સ ઓફ ઇન્ડિપેન્ડન્ટ ઓથર્સ એ એકમાત્ર વૈશ્વિક, ગેરનફા સંસ્થા છે.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":48,"output_tokens":275}},"cost":0.00017124,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_51","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nSymptoms of poisoning include nausea, vomiting, headaches and fainting.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Příznaky otravy zahrnují nevolnost, zvracení, bolesti hlavy a mdloby.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Příznaky otravy zahrnují nevolnost, zvracení, bolesti hlavy a mdloby.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":44,"output_tokens":71}},"cost":4.832e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_211","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nThe annual International Consumer Electronics Show (CES), held between January 9 (January 10, Beijing time) and 12, opened in Las Vegas, USA.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"一年一度的国际消费电子展（CES）于1月9日（北京时间1月10日）至12日在美国拉斯维加斯开幕。\n\nThe translation preserves the original sentence structure while rendering the event name with its standard Chinese equivalent (国际消费电子展), converting the date range and parenthetical time-zone clarification verbatim, and using the conventional term “开幕” for “opened.” The result is concise, idiomatic Chinese that retains all factual content.\n\n\\boxed{一年一度的国际消费电子展（CES）于1月9日（北京时间1月10日）至12日在美国拉斯维加斯开幕。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":183,"output_tokens":131},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.00010210000000000002,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_739","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nA study from consultancy firm Deloitte and the Federal Association of Interactive Entertainment Software (BIU) predicts rapid growth for the e-sport.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Eine Studie des Beratungsunternehmens Deloitte und des Bundesverbandes Interaktive Unterhaltungssoftware (BIU) prognostiziert dem E-Sport ein schnelles Wachstum.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":57,"output_tokens":51}},"cost":3.801e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_318","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nThe missing were identified as David King, 53; Josh Pepperd, 42; and Andrew Pepperd, 11, according to KTVA.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence reports the identification of missing persons in a news context, so the Gujarati rendering must preserve the factual tone, the proper names (transliterated into Gujarati script), the ages (kept as Arabic numerals), and the attribution to the source KTVA.\n\nA natural, idiomatic translation is therefore:\n\nKTVA અનુસાર ગુમ થયેલાઓને ડેવિડ કિંગ, 53; જોશ પેપર્ડ, 42; અને એન્ડ્ર્યુ પેપર્ડ, 11 તરીકે ઓળખવામાં આવ્યા હતા.\n\nThis rendering keeps the original sentence structure, uses the conventional Gujarati term “ગુમ થયેલાઓ” for “the missing,” and places the attribution at the beginning for idiomatic flow while retaining all factual content unchanged.\n\n\\boxed{KTVA અનુસાર ગુમ થયેલાઓને ડેવિડ કિંગ, 53; જોશ પેપર્ડ, 42; અને એન્ડ્ર્યુ પેપર્ડ, 11 તરીકે ઓળખવામાં આવ્યા હતા.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":183,"output_tokens":290},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001816,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_135","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nSwimming Pools Alternate\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\"Swimming pools\" translates to \"તરણ તળાવો\" in Gujarati.  \n\"Alternate\" translates to \"વૈકલ્પિક\" (or \"વારાફરથી\" depending on context).  \nCombining them literally while preserving the given word order therefore yields the Gujarati phrase તરણ તળાવો વૈકલ્પિક.\n\n\\boxed{તરણ તળાવો વૈકલ્પિક}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":157,"output_tokens":107},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":8.49e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_762","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nIn the last few years, China’s scientific publications have grown rapidly, particularly in the computer science and engineering fields.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"在过去几年里，中国的科学出版物增长迅速，尤其是在计算机科学和工程领域。\n\n\\boxed{近年来，中国的科学出版物增长迅速，尤其是在计算机科学和工程领域。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":173,"output_tokens":39},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":5.41e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_493","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe green-and-white Sikorsky VH-3D, known as Marine One when the President is aboard, was the centerpiece of the July 17 event at the White House showcasing American construction programs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Der grün-weiße Sikorsky VH-3D, der mit Präsident an Bord als Marine One bekannt ist, stand im Mittelpunkt der Veranstaltung am 17. Juli im Weißen Haus, die amerikanische Bauprojekte präsentierte.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":69,"output_tokens":64}},"cost":4.737e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_485","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nA powerful 7.5 magnitude earthquake hit the Indonesian island of Sulawesi on Friday, September 29, triggering a tsunami and leaving nearly 400 people dead.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"શુક્રવાર, 29 સપ્ટેમ્બરે ઇન્ડોનેશિયાના ટાપુ સુલાવેસીમાં 7.5 મેગ્નિટ્યૂડનો ભૂકંપ આવ્યો, જેના કારણે સુનામી આવી અને લગભગ 400 લોકોનાં મૃત્યુ થયાં.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{શુક્રવાર, 29 સપ્ટેમ્બરે ઇન્ડોનેશિયાના ટાપુ સુલાવેસીમાં 7.5 મેગ્નિટ્યૂડનો ભૂકંપ આવ્યો, જેના કારણે સુનામી આવી અને લગભગ 400 લોકોનાં મૃત્યુ થયાં.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":66,"output_tokens":433}},"cost":0.00026838000000000003,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_90","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe bombs of the Allies tore many holes in the city centre in December 1944.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Die Bomben der Alliierten rissen im Dezember 1944 viele Löcher in das Stadtzentrum.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":48,"output_tokens":31}},"cost":2.484e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_573","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nHillary Clinton, wife of former US President Bill Clinton, was delivering a speech at the meeting of the Institute of Scrap Recycling Industries at hotel Mandalay Bay on Thursday evening.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence can be translated into Gujarati by preserving proper nouns (names of people, organizations, and places) in transliterated form while rendering the remainder of the sentence according to standard Gujarati syntax and vocabulary:\n\n- “Hillary Clinton” becomes હિલેરી ક્લિન્ટન.  \n- The appositive phrase “wife of former US President Bill Clinton” is rendered as ભૂતપૂર્વ અમેરિકી પ્રમુખ બિલ ક્લિન્ટનની પત્ની.  \n- “Was delivering a speech” is expressed by the continuous-past construction ભાષણ આપતાં હતાં.  \n- “At the meeting of the Institute of Scrap Recycling Industries” is translated as ઇન્સ્ટિટ્યૂટ ઑફ સ્ક્રેપ રિસાઇકલિંગ ઇન્ડસ્ટ્રીઝની મીટિંગમાં.  \n- “At hotel Mandalay Bay” is rendered હોટલ મેન્ડાલે બે ખાતે.  \n- “On Thursday evening” becomes ગુરુવારે સાંજે.\n\nConcatenating these segments in Gujarati word order yields the complete translation.\n\n\\boxed{હિલેરી ક્લિન્ટન, ભૂતપૂર્વ અમેરિકી પ્રમુખ બિલ ક્લિન્ટનની પત્ની, ગુરુવારે સાંજે હોટલ મેન્ડાલે બે ખાતે ઇન્સ્ટિટ્યૂટ ઑફ સ્ક્રેપ રિસાઇકલિંગ ઇન્ડસ્ટ્રીઝની મીટિંગમાં ભાષણ આપતાં હતાં.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":187,"output_tokens":452},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002634,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_803","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nApart from seven rooms, Nana Patekar's farmhouse also has a large hall .\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence breaks down into three key segments for translation:  \n- “Apart from seven rooms” renders as “સાત રૂમ સિવાય”.  \n- The possessive noun phrase “Nana Patekar’s farmhouse” is kept phonetically intact as a proper name and rendered “નાના પટેકરના ફાર્મહાઉસ”.  \n- “Also has a large hall” becomes “એક મોટો હોલ પણ છે”.  \n\nThese segments are concatenated while preserving Gujarati subject–object–verb order and the original concessive sense, yielding the natural sentence  \n“સાત રૂમ સિવાય, નાના પટેકરના ફાર્મહાઉસમાં એક મોટો હોલ પણ છે.”  \n\n\\boxed{સાત રૂમ સિવાય, નાના પટેકરના ફાર્મહાઉસમાં એક મોટો હોલ પણ છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":169,"output_tokens":238},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001528,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_673","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nThe Distinguished Gentleman's Ride was founded in Sydney, Australia by Mark Hawwa.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence contains a proper name (“The Distinguished Gentleman’s Ride”) that is conventionally transliterated rather than translated, together with factual information whose Gujarati rendering follows standard grammatical order (subject–object–verb) and uses the passive construction commonly employed for statements about founding events.\n\nTransliteration of the proper name yields “ધ ડિસ્ટિંગ્વિશ્ડ જેન્ટલમેન્સ રાઇડ”.  \nThe locative phrase “in Sydney, Australia” becomes “ઓસ્ટ્રેલિયાના સિડનીમાં”.  \nThe agentive phrase “by Mark Hawwa” becomes “માર્ક હવ્વા દ્વારા”.  \nThe predicate “was founded” is expressed by the passive “સ્થાપના કરવામાં આવી હતી”.\n\nConcatenating these elements produces the single, idiomatic Gujarati sentence  \n“ધ ડિસ્ટિંગ્વિશ્ડ જેન્ટલમેન્સ રાઇડની સ્થાપના ઓસ્ટ્રેલિયાના સિડનીમાં માર્ક હવ્વા દ્વારા કરવામાં આવી હતી.”\n\n\\boxed{ધ ડિસ્ટિંગ્વિશ્ડ જેન્ટલમેન્સ રાઇડની સ્થાપના ઓસ્ટ્રેલિયાના સિડનીમાં માર્ક હવ્વા દ્વારા કરવામાં આવી હતી.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":168,"output_tokens":388},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002276,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_563","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nBrooks is a 71-year-old former Georgia state congressman and lifelong civil rights activist.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Brooks je 71letý bývalý poslanec státního parlamentu Georgie a celoživotní aktivista za občanská práva.  \n\\boxed{\\text{Brooks je 71letý bývalý poslanec státního parlamentu Georgie a celoživotní aktivista za občanská práva.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":49,"output_tokens":90}},"cost":6.037e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_522","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nIndia's junior cricket team defeated Australia by 8 wickets in the U-19 World Cup final on February 3. This is the fourth time and Indian U-19 team has created a record in their name.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{\\text{ભારતની જુનિયર ક્રિકેટ ટીમે 3 ફેબ્રુઆરીએ U-19 વર્લ્ડ કપના ફાઇનલમાં ઓસ્ટ્રેલિયાને 8 વિકેટથી હરાવ્યું. આ ચોથી વખત છે જ્યારે ભારતીય U-19 ટીમે તેમના નામે રેકોર્ડ કર્યો છે.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":75,"output_tokens":248}},"cost":0.00015854999999999998,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-kk-en_528","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Kazakh.\n\nWhen the global financial crisis and ensuing recession hit in 2007-2009, the Fed cut its policy rate from 5.25% to 0%.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\"2007-2009 жылдары жаһандық қаржы дағдарысы және одан кейінгі рецессия басталған кезде ФРЖ өзінің саясат мөлшерлемесін 5,25%-дан 0%-ға дейін төмендетті.\"\n\n\\boxed{2007-2009 жж. жаһандық қаржы дағдарысы мен одан туындаған рецессия басталғанда ФРЖ өзінің саясат мөлшерлемесін 5,25%-дан 0%-ға дейін төмендетті.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":183,"output_tokens":142},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001076,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_246","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nSince 2005, civil rights activists have returned to the Moore's Ford Bridge to recreate the night two black couples - Roger and Dorothy Malcom, and George and 