12 years ago.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"પ્રથમ અલ્સ્ટર લેમ્બરેટા ક્લબ 1970ના દાયકાની શરૂઆતમાં બંધ થઈ ગઈ હતી પરંતુ 12 વર્ષ પહેલાં તેનું પુનઃગઠન કરવામાં આવ્યું હતું.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{પ્રથમ અલ્સ્ટર લેમ્બરેટા ક્લબ 1970ના દાયકાની શરૂઆતમાં બંધ થઈ ગઈ હતી પરંતુ 12 વર્ષ પહેલાં તેનું પુનઃગઠન કરવામાં આવ્યું હતું.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":59,"output_tokens":361}},"cost":0.00022427,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_85","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe Mirror.co.uk reported on the sale.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to translate is \"The Mirror.co.uk reported on the sale.\"\n\n- \"Mirror.co.uk\" is a proper name (a UK news website) and is left unchanged.\n- \"Reported on\" is rendered in the past tense as the natural Czech verb \"informoval o\".\n- \"The sale\" translates directly to \"prodeji\" (locative case after the preposition \"o\").\n\nCombining these elements produces the fluent Czech sentence \"Mirror.co.uk informoval o prodeji.\"\n\n\\boxed{Mirror.co.uk informoval o prodeji.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":161,"output_tokens":112},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":8.82e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_377","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe report in the journal Current Biology described it as 'the best-preserved armored dinosaur ever found, and one of the best dinosaur specimens in the world.'\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Der Bericht in der Fachzeitschrift Current Biology beschrieb ihn als „das am besten erhaltene gepanzerte Dinosaurierfossil, das jemals gefunden wurde, und eines der besten Dinosaurier-Exemplare der Welt.“}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":59,"output_tokens":56}},"cost":4.127e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_921","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nApart from this, many types of trees have been grown around the farmhouse.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence can be segmented for translation as follows:\n\n- “Apart from this” renders naturally in Gujarati as the connective phrase “આ ઉપરાંત” (or the synonymous “આ સિવાય”).\n- “Many types of trees” is expressed by the noun phrase “અનેક પ્રકારના વૃક્ષો” (plural masculine).\n- “Have been grown” is conveyed by the passive construction “ઉગાડવામાં આવ્યા છે”.\n- “Around the farmhouse” becomes the locative phrase “ફાર્મહાઉસની આસપાસ”; the English loan-word “ફાર્મહાઉસ” is retained because it is conventionally used in Gujarati agricultural contexts.\n\nConcatenating these segments yields the fluent Gujarati sentence  \n“આ ઉપરાંત ફાર્મહાઉસની આસપાસ અનેક પ્રકારના વૃક્ષો ઉગાડવામાં આવ્યા છે.”\n\n(The alternative wording “આ સિવાય, ફાર્મહાઉસની આસપાસ ઘણા પ્રકારના વૃક્ષો ઉગાડવામાં આવ્યા છે” is equally acceptable.)\n\n\\boxed{આ ઉપરાંત, ફાર્મહાઉસની આસપાસ અનેક પ્રકારના વૃક્ષો ઉગાડવામાં આવ્યા છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":167,"output_tokens":352},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002094,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_19","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nThe play's ensemble features Kerry Washington, Steven Pasquale, Eugene Lee and Jeremy Jordan.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{\\text{Spektaklio ansamblį sudaro Kerė Vasington, Steivenas Paskvale, Džiūnas Li ir Džeremis Džordžanas.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":49,"output_tokens":47}},"cost":3.4569999999999996e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_719","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nCounselor to the President Kellyanne Conway said Sunday morning that she is a victim of sexual assault.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"પ્રમુખના સલાહકાર કેલીએન કોન્વેએ રવિવાર સવારે કહ્યું કે તે જાતીય હુમલાની પીડિત છે.\n\nThe English sentence is segmented into its core components for translation: the subject and title (“Counselor to the President Kellyanne Conway”), the reporting verb and time phrase (“said Sunday morning”), and the reported clause (“that she is a victim of sexual assault”).  \n\n- “Counselor to the President” is rendered by the established Gujarati compound પ્રમુખના સલાહકાર.  \n- The proper name Kellyanne Conway is transliterated directly as કેલીએન કોન્વે.  \n- “Said Sunday morning” becomes the natural temporal expression રવિવાર સવારે કહ્યું.  \n- “Victim of sexual assault” is translated with the conventional legal phrase જાતીય હુમલાની પીડિત, preserving both meaning and register.  \n\nThese segments are then concatenated according to Gujarati word-order conventions, yielding a single, grammatically well-formed sentence that conveys the original meaning without addition or omission.\n\n\\boxed{પ્રમુખના સલાહકાર કેલીએન કોન્વેએ રવિવાર સવારે કહ્યું કે તે જાતીય હુમલાની પીડિત છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":172,"output_tokens":336},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002024,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_849","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nPrithvi Shaw scored 134 runs in the debut test, and set 7 records.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"પૃથ્વી શૉએ પ્રથમ ટેસ્ટમાં 134 રન બનાવ્યા અને 7 રેકોર્ડ સ્થાપિત કર્યા.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{પૃથ્વી શૉએ પ્રથમ ટેસ્ટમાં 134 રન બનાવ્યા અને 7 રેકોર્ડ સ્થાપિત કર્યા.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":50,"output_tokens":209}},"cost":0.00013189999999999998,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_504","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nVictor (Ken Marino) still hasn't lost his virginity.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is “Victor (Ken Marino) still hasn’t lost his virginity.”\n\n- Proper names and parenthetical credits are left unchanged: “Victor (Ken Marino)”.\n- The English present-perfect construction “hasn’t lost” is rendered by the Czech perfective verb “nepřišel o”.\n- The adverb “still” is expressed by “stále”.\n- The idiom “lost his virginity” is conventionally translated as “přišel o panictví” (the masculine form of “virginity”).\n\nCombining these elements yields the natural Czech sentence  \n“Victor (Ken Marino) stále nepřišel o panictví.”\n\n\\boxed{Victor (Ken Marino) stále nepřišel o panictví.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":163,"output_tokens":151},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001081,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_757","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nDuring the Great Indian Amazon Sale, you will get a huge discount on OnePlus 6.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"ગ્રેટ ઇન્ડિયન એમેઝોન સેલ દરમિયાન, તમને વનપ્લસ 6 પર મોટી છૂટ મળશે.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{ગ્રેટ ઇન્ડિયન એમેઝોન સેલ દરમિયાન, તમને વનપ્લસ 6 પર મોટી છૂટ મળશે.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":47,"output_tokens":199}},"cost":0.00012550999999999998,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_907","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nRavindra Jadeja played a 100-run innings in Rajkot, during this time he scored 5 fours and 5 sixes.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"રવિન્દ્ર જાડેજાએ રાજકોટમાં ૧૦૦ રનની ઇનિંગ્સ રમી, આ દરમિયાન તેણે ૫ ફોર અને ૫ સિક્સ માર્યા.\n\n\\boxed{રવિન્દ્ર જાડેજાએ રાજકોટમાં ૧૦૦ રનની ઇનિંગ્સ રમી, આ દરમિયાન તેણે ૫ ફોર અને ૫ સિક્સ માર્યા.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":181,"output_tokens":157},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001147,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_871","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nNo, really - he wrote me beautiful letters, and they're great letters,\" he said.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence consists of quoted speech followed by an attribution. A direct, natural translation into Gujarati preserves the original tense, punctuation, and emphasis while using idiomatic Gujarati phrasing:\n\n- “No, really” becomes “ના, ખરેખર”.  \n- “he wrote me beautiful letters” becomes “તેણે મને સુંદર પત્રો લખ્યા”.  \n- “and they’re great letters” becomes “અને તે ઉત્તમ પત્રો છે”.  \n- The closing attribution “he said” becomes “તેણે કહ્યું”.\n\nCombining these elements yields the complete Gujarati rendering:\n\n“ના, ખરેખર – તેણે મને સુંદર પત્રો લખ્યા, અને તે ઉત્તમ પત્રો છે,” તેણે કહ્યું.\n\n\\boxed{“ના, ખરેખર - તેણે મને સુંદર પત્રો લખ્યા, અને તે ઉત્તમ પત્રો છે,” તેણે કહ્યું.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":170,"output_tokens":261},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001645,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_14","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe second was the We-Vibe vibrator for couples.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to translate is \"The second was the We-Vibe vibrator for couples.\"\n\n- \"The second\" is rendered as \"Druhý\" (masculine, matching the implied item in a list).\n- \"Was\" translates directly to the past-tense form \"byl\".\n- The brand name \"We-Vibe\" is left unchanged.\n- \"Vibrator\" becomes the standard Czech equivalent \"vibrátor\".\n- \"For couples\" is translated as the natural prepositional phrase \"pro páry\".\n\nCombining these elements produces the literal yet idiomatic Czech sentence \"Druhý byl We-Vibe vibrátor pro páry.\"\n\n\\boxed{Druhý byl We-Vibe vibrátor pro páry.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":163,"output_tokens":145},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.00010510000000000001,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_26","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nIt is understood that Chongqing currently owns 18 shale gas exploration rights established by Ministry of Land and Resources as the first domestic shale gas mining rights - the Sinopec Fuling shale gas field.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"据了解，重庆目前拥有18个由国土资源部设立的页岩气勘探权，即国内首个页岩气采矿权——中石化涪陵页岩气田。\n\nThe original English sentence is somewhat awkwardly phrased and mixes the terms “exploration rights” and “mining rights,” but the core meaning is preserved by rendering “It is understood that” as the conventional journalistic opener “据悉,” treating the 18 rights as items established by the Ministry of Land and Resources, and explicitly identifying the Fuling field as the first domestic mining right. The translation therefore supplies the minimal grammatical links needed for natural Chinese while staying faithful to the source wording and terminology (勘探权/采矿权).\n\n\\boxed{据悉，重庆目前拥有18个由国土资源部设立的页岩气勘探权，即国内首个页岩气采矿权—中石化涪陵页岩气田。\n}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":188,"output_tokens":188},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001316,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_969","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nSensex hit a record high of 38,920 and , Nifty also touched 11,750 mark\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"સેન્સેક્સનો 38,920 નો રેકોર્ડ ઉચ્ચ સ્તર હિટ કર્યો અને નિફ્ટીએ પણ 11,750 નો આંક સ્પર્શ કર્યો\n\n\\boxed{{સેન્સેક્સનો 38,920 નો રેકોર્ડ ઉચ્ચ સ્તર હિટ કર્યો અને નિફ્ટીએ પણ 11,750 નો આંક સ્પર્શ કર્યો}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":58,"output_tokens":268}},"cost":0.00016833999999999998,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_732","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nIn the 2000s, the disease was also discovered in finches.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence to be translated is “In the 2000s, the disease was also discovered in finches.”\n\n- “In the 2000s” is rendered in Finnish as the adessive phrase “2000-luvulla”.\n- “The disease” is simply “tauti”.\n- “Was … discovered” is expressed by the passive past-tense verb “löydettiin”.\n- “Also” is the adverb “myös”.\n- “In finches” uses the inessive plural of the standard ornithological term for finches (Fringillidae), which is “peipoissa”.\n\nPutting these elements together yields the grammatically natural Finnish sentence  \n“2000-luvulla tauti löydettiin myös peipoissa.”\n\n\\boxed{2000-luvulla tauti löydettiin myös peipoissa.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":166,"output_tokens":167},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001167,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_408","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nIn addition, Mr. Ambani has announced that the very eagerly awaited Jio Giga fiber, fix-line broadband will be open for registration from the 15th of August, 2018.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"ઉપરાંત, શ્રી અંબાણીએ જાહેરાત કરી હતી કે ખૂબ જ ઉત્સુકતાથી રાહ જોવાતી જિયો ગીગા ફાઇબર, ફિક્સ-લાઇન બ્રોડબેન્ડ 15 ઓગસ્ટ, 2018 થી રજિસ્ટ્રેશન માટે ખુલ્લી રહેશે. \\boxed{{ઉપરાંત, શ્રી અંબાણીએ જાહેરાત કરી હતી કે ખૂબ જ ઉત્સુકતાથી રાહ જોવાતી જિયો ગીગા ફાઇબર, ફિક્સ-લાઇન બ્રોડબેન્ડ 15 ઓગસ્ટ, 2018 થી રજિસ્ટ્રેશન માટે ખુલ્લી રહેશે.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":72,"output_tokens":455}},"cost":0.00028236,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_285","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nOn Aug. 9, 2014, Brittany Ferrell was shaken to her core.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is “On Aug. 9, 2014, Brittany Ferrell was shaken to her core.”  \n\n- The date is rendered in the conventional Finnish order and morphology: “9. elokuuta 2014.”  \n- The proper name “Brittany Ferrell” remains unchanged.  \n- The English idiom “shaken to her core” is expressed by the natural Finnish collocation “järkyttyi sydänjuuriaan myöten,” which conveys deep emotional disturbance while preserving the original passive construction.  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent Finnish sentence  \n\n9. elokuuta 2014 Brittany Ferrell järkyttyi sydänjuuriaan myöten.\n\n\\boxed{9. elokuuta 2014 Brittany Ferrell järkyttyi sydänjuuriaan myöten.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":169,"output_tokens":170},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.00011880000000000001,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_597","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nJoining the trio in the field are former Masters winner Ian Woosnam and Senior major champions Paul Broadhurst, Roger Chapman, Mark James and Mark McNulty.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence describes golfers joining a tournament field and must be rendered in natural German while preserving the inverted structure, golf terminology, and list format.  \n\n- Begin with the prepositional phrase “Zum Trio im Feld” to mirror the original fronted element.  \n- Use the idiomatic verb “stoßen … zu” (or the near-synonym “gesellen sich … zu”) to convey “joining.”  \n- Translate “former Masters winner” as “ehemalige Masters-Sieger,” keeping the proper noun “Masters” unchanged.  \n- Render “Senior major champions” as the compact compound “Senior-Major-Champions,” a conventional term in German golf reporting.  \n- Retain all personal names exactly as given and apply standard German list punctuation (commas plus a final “und”).  \n\nThe resulting sentence therefore reads:  \nZum Trio im Feld stoßen der ehemalige Masters-Sieger Ian Woosnam und die Senior-Major-Champions Paul Broadhurst、Roger Chapman、Mark James und Mark McNulty.\n\n\\boxed{Zum Trio im Feld stoßen der ehem. Masters-Sieger Ian Woosnam u. die Senior-Major-Champions Paul Broadhurst, Roger Chapman, Mark James u. Mark McNulty.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":184,"output_tokens":258},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001658,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_524","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nWhat a fool, nothing wrong with you Jess.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence consists of two distinct parts that must be translated separately and then combined for natural flow in Gujarati:\n\n- “What a fool” is an exclamatory expression of foolishness, rendered as “કેવો મૂર્ખ”.\n- “Nothing wrong with you Jess” is a reassuring clause addressed to the person named Jess; “nothing wrong with you” becomes “તને કશું ખોટું નથી” and the proper name “Jess” is retained in its original form as “જેસ”.\n\nConcatenating the two parts while preserving the original punctuation and word order yields the complete Gujarati sentence “કેવો મૂર્ખ, તને કશું ખોટું નથી જેસ.”\n\n\\boxed{કેવો મૂર્ખ, તને કશું ખોટું નથી જેસ.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":162,"output_tokens":193},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001289,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_289","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAs the cultural establishment announced on Thursday, singers Gloria Estefan (59) and Lionel Richie (68), as well as choreographer Carmen de Lavallade (86) and the TV producer Norman Lear (95) are also among those being honoured.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Wie die kulturelle Institution am Donnerstag bekanntgab, gehören zu den Geehrten unter anderem die Sänger Gloria Estefan (59) und Lionel Richie (68) sowie die Choreografin Carmen de Lavallade (86) und der Fernsehproduzent Norman Lear (95).\n\n\\boxed{{Wie die kulturelle Institution am Donnerstag bekanntgab, gehören zu den Geehrten unter anderem die Sänger Gloria Estefan (59) und Lionel Richie (68) sowie die Choreografin Carmen de Lavallade (86) und der Fernsehproduzent Norman Lear (95).}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":83,"output_tokens":141}},"cost":9.538999999999999e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_552","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nOrr and former Ryder Cup captain Sam Torrance are among six Scots in the field, the others being Andrew Oldcorn, Stephen McAllister, Bill Longmuir and Ross Drummond.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Orr und der ehemalige Ryder-Cup-Kapitän Sam Torrance gehören zu den sechs Schotten im Teilnehmerfeld; die anderen sind Andrew Oldcorn, Stephen McAllister, Bill Longmuir und Ross Drummond.\n\n\\boxed{Orr u. ehem. Ryder-Cup-Kpt. Sam Torrance gehören zu den 6 Schotten im Feld, die anderen sind A. Oldcorn, S. McAllister, B. Longmuir u. R. Drummond.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":187,"output_tokens":100},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":8.74e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_992","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nThe helicopter was identified as an Airbus H125, on a long distance trip out of Grand Prairie, Texas.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"હેલિકોપ્ટરને ગ્રાન્ડ પ્રેરી, ટેક્સાસમાંથી લાંબી મુસાફરી પર જતાં એરબસ H125 તરીકે ઓળખવામાં આવ્યું હતું.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{હેલિકોપ્ટરને ગ્રાન્ડ પ્રેરી, ટેક્સાસમાંથી લાંબી મુસાફરી પર જતાં એરબસ H125 તરીકે ઓળખવામાં આવ્યું હતું.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":53,"output_tokens":305}},"cost":0.00018989,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-kk-en_52","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Kazakh.\n\nAfter Japan’s attack on Pearl Harbor, US stock markets fell by 10%, but recovered within six weeks.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Жапонияның Перл-Харборға шабуылынан кейін АҚШ қор нарықтары 10%-ға төмендеді, бірақ алты апта ішінде қалпына келді.\n\n\\boxed{Жапонияның Перл-Харборға шабуылынан кейін АҚШ қор нарықтары 10%-ға төмендеді, бірақ алты апта ішінде қалпына келді.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":172,"output_tokens":113},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":9.09e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_170","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe main character in the film \"Crazy Island\" is a giraffe – Mordillo's favourite animal in his drawings – who has a millipede as his nemesis.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Die Hauptfigur im Film „Crazy Island“ ist eine Giraffe – Mordillos Lieblingstier in seinen Zeichnungen –, die einen Tausendfüßer als Erzfeind hat.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":65,"output_tokens":50}},"cost":3.845e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_125","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe French army commander had occupied Bavaria since the spring in 1800, during the War of the Second Coalition with Austria.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is:\n\n\"The French army commander had occupied Bavaria since the spring in 1800, during the War of the Second Coalition with Austria.\"\n\nA direct, literal rendering into German that preserves both meaning and tense is required. The subject phrase \"The French army commander\" becomes \"Der französische Armeekommandant\". The past-perfect construction \"had occupied … since the spring in 1800\" is rendered by the German past perfect \"hatte … seit dem Frühjahr 1800 besetzt\". The prepositional phrase \"during the War of the Second Coalition with Austria\" is translated as \"während des Krieges der Zweiten Koalition mit Österreich\", keeping the original wording (including the preposition \"mit\") unchanged.\n\nPutting these elements together yields the grammatically correct and stylistically neutral German sentence:\n\nDer französische Armeekommandant hatte Bayern seit dem Frühjahr 1800 besetzt, während des Krieges der Zweiten Koalition mit Österreich.\n\n\\boxed{Der frz. Armeekommandant hatte Bayern seit Frühjahr 1800 besetzt, während des Kriegs der 2. Koalition mit Österreich.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":175,"output_tokens":245},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001575,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_932","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nJaved Miandad and Steve Smith (49) are at number two in this matter.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence appears to reference a ranking or list (likely in a cricket context, given the proper names involved). Proper names are left unchanged, while the remainder is rendered idiomatically in Gujarati using standard vocabulary and word order:\n\n- “Javed Miandad” → જાવેદ મિયાંદાદ  \n- “Steve Smith (49)” → સ્ટીવ સ્મિથ (49)  \n- “are at number two” → નંબર બે પર છે  \n- “in this matter” (i.e., “in this regard”) → આ બાબતે  \n\nCombining these elements yields the natural Gujarati sentence  \nજાવેદ મિયાંદાદ અને સ્ટીવ સ્મિથ (49) આ બાબતે નંબર બે પર છે.\n\n\\boxed{જાવેદ મિયાંદાદ અને સ્ટીવ સ્મિથ (49) આ બાબતે નંબર બે પર છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":171,"output_tokens":240},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001542,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_127","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nMahesh Sahu's 17-year-old son Shivam disappeared on September 30 at 1 pm.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence is translated by breaking it into components and rendering each accurately in Gujarati while preserving natural word order and grammar:\n\n- Possessive “Mahesh Sahu’s” becomes મહેશ સાહુના.  \n- “17-year-old son” is expressed as 17 વર્ષના પુત્ર.  \n- The proper name “Shivam” remains શિવમ.  \n- “Disappeared” is rendered with the common idiomatic phrase ગાયબ થઈ ગયો.  \n- The date-time expression “on September 30 at 1 pm” is written as 30 સપ્ટેમ્બરે બપોરે 1 વાગે.\n\nCombining these yields the complete, idiomatic Gujarati sentence.\n\n\\boxed{મહેશ સાહુના 17 વર્ષના પુત્ર શિવમ 30 સપ્ટેમ્બરે બપોરે 1 વાગે ગાયબ થઈ ગયો.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":174,"output_tokens":239},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001543,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_116","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nRegistration for Jio Giga Fiber will start on the 15th of August.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is \"Registration for Jio Giga Fiber will start on the 15th of August.\"\n\n- Proper nouns such as \"Jio Giga Fiber\" are retained in transliterated form: જીઓ ગિગા ફાઇબર.  \n- The noun \"registration\" is rendered by the standard Gujarati equivalent નોંધણી.  \n- The preposition \"for\" is expressed by the postposition માટે (or, for smoother phrasing, by attaching the genitive marker ની to the preceding noun).  \n- The future-tense verb phrase \"will start\" is translated as શરૂ થશે.  \n- The temporal expression \"on the 15th of August\" is rendered concisely as 15 ઓગસ્ટથી (or 15 ઓગસ્ટે), which is the conventional way to indicate a starting date in Gujarati.\n\nCombining these elements yields the grammatically natural Gujarati sentence  \nજીઓ ગિગા ફાઇબરની નોંધણી 15 ઓગસ્ટથી શરૂ થશે.\n\n\\boxed{જીઓ ગિગા ફાઇબરની નોંધણી 15 ઓગસ્ટથી શરૂ થશે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":169,"output_tokens":301},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001843,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_175","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nDamascus reopens main Syria-Jordan trade crossing for 1st time in 3 years\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence is a news headline, so the Gujarati rendering must preserve a concise, headline-style structure while remaining grammatically natural.  \n\n- Proper nouns are transliterated directly: Damascus → દમાસ્કસ, Syria → સીરિયા, Jordan → જોર્ડન.  \n- “Reopens … crossing” is rendered with the verb phrase “ફરી ખોલે છે” to convey resumption of operation.  \n- “Main … trade crossing” becomes “મુખ્ય … વેપારી ક્રોસિંગ,” the standard journalistic phrasing for a border-trade point.  \n- The temporal phrase “for 1st time in 3 years” is compactly expressed as “૩ વર્ષમાં પહેલી વખત.”  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent headline translation below.\n\n\\boxed{દમાસ્કસ ૩ વર્ષમાં પહેલી વખત સીરિયા-જોર્ડનનો મુખ્ય વેપારી ક્રોસિંગ ફરી ખોલે છે}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":172,"output_tokens":253},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001609,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_516","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nOr The Smuggler, which features 18th-century contrabander Arthur Darrell, who is thought to have staged his own funeral by filling a coffin with rocks (a discovery made years later when his coffin was unearthed).\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Oder Der Schmuggler, der den Schmuggler Arthur Darrell aus dem 18. Jahrhundert zeigt, von dem man annimmt, er habe seine eigene Beerdigung inszeniert, indem er einen Sarg mit Steinen füllte (eine Entdeckung, die Jahre später gemacht wurde, als sein Sarg ausgegraben wurde).}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":76,"output_tokens":87}},"cost":6.208e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_638","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nHeroin (featuring SZA, Jay Rock, Isaiah Rashad, & Ab Soul\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The given text appears to be a song or track title, where the word \"featuring\" indicates the guest artists. Proper nouns such as the main title \"Heroin\" and the artist names are transliterated into Gujarati script while preserving their recognizable forms. The English term \"featuring\" is rendered by the natural Gujarati equivalent \"સાથે\" (meaning \"with\"), which is the conventional way to express featured artists in Gujarati. The ampersand \"&\" is expanded to the Gujarati conjunction \"અને\".\n\nPutting these elements together produces the fluent Gujarati rendering  \nહેરોઇન (SZA, Jay Rock, Isaiah Rashad અને Ab Soul સાથે).\n\n\\boxed{હેરોઇન (SZA, Jay Rock, Isaiah Rashad અને Ab Soul સાથે)\n}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":171,"output_tokens":179},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001237,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_197","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nA Million Little Pieces and Camping star Juliette Lewis confirmed via Twitter she has joined the cast of the Roseanne spinoff The Conners.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence describes an entertainment news item involving actress Juliette Lewis and TV/film titles, so proper names are transliterated while the remainder is rendered in natural Gujarati syntax and vocabulary.\n\n- “A Million Little Pieces and Camping star” becomes “એ મિલિયન લિટલ પીસીસ અને કેમ્પિંગની અભિનેત્રી”.  \n- “confirmed via Twitter” becomes “ટ્વિટર પર પુષ્ટિ કરી છે”.  \n- “she has joined the cast of the Roseanne spinoff The Conners” becomes “તેણે રોઝાન્ને સ્પિનઑફ ધ કોનર્સના કલાકારોમાં જોડાવાની છે”.\n\nConcatenating these segments yields the complete, grammatically correct Gujarati sentence.\n\n\\boxed{એ મિલિયન લિટલ પીસીસ અને કેમ્પિંગની અભિનેત્રી જુલિયેટ લેવિસે ટ્વિટર પર પુષ્ટિ કરી છે કે તેણે રોઝાન્ને સ્પિનઑફ ધ કોનર્સના કલાકારોમાં જોડાવાની છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":179,"output_tokens":318},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001948,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_58","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nAccording to the report, in 2017 there were 155 models of electric cars in the world.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence is translated into Gujarati by mapping each segment to its natural equivalent while preserving meaning, grammar, and word order:\n\n- “According to the report” becomes “રિપોર્ટ અનુસાર”.\n- “In 2017” is rendered with Gujarati digits as “૨૦૧૭માં”.\n- “There were … models” is expressed as “મોડલ હતાં” (plural agreement).\n- “Of electric cars” is “ઇલેક્ટ્રિક કારનાં”.\n- “In the world” is “વિશ્વમાં”.\n\nConcatenating these segments yields the fluent Gujarati sentence  \n“રિપોર્ટ અનુસાર, ૨૦૧૭માં વિશ્વમાં ઇલેક્ટ્રિક કારનાં ૧૫૫ મોડલ હતાં.”\n\n\\boxed{રિપોર્ટ અનુસાર, ૨૦૧૭માં વિશ્વમાં ઇલેક્ટ્રિક કારનાં ૧૫૫ મોડલ હતાં.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":173,"output_tokens":256},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001626,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_576","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nRokid previously raised US$8.3 million in August 2014 in the Angel Round from IDG, Linear Venture, Mfund and Vision Capital. In October 2014, the company again received at least US$10 million in Series A funding led by Walden International, with the Angel investors as participants. On November 1, 2016, Rokid completed Series B funding, led by Advantech Capital; other investors included IDG, Mfund, Vision Capital and Walden International.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Rokid 于2014年8月在天使轮中获得了来自IDG、Linear Venture、Mfund和Vision Capital的830万美元投资。2014年10月，该公司再次获得由华登国际领投的至少1000万美元A轮融资，天使轮投资方也参与其中。2016年11月1日，Rokid完成了由Advantech Capital领投的B轮融资，其他投资方包括IDG、Mfund、Vision Capital和华登国际。\n\n\\boxed{Rokid 于2014年8月在天使轮中获得了来自IDG、Linear Venture、Mfund和Vision Capital的830万美元投资。2014年10月，该公司再次获得由华登国际领投的至少1000万美元A轮融资，天使轮投资方也参与其中。2016年11月1日，Rokid完成了由Advantech Capital领投的B轮融资，其他投资方包括IDG、Mfund、Vision Capital和华登国际。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":141,"output_tokens":235}},"cost":0.00015933,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-ru-en_222","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Russian.\n\nHardy was born in 1925 in the English resort town of Cheltenham.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is:\n\nHardy was born in 1925 in the English resort town of Cheltenham.\n\nA direct, accurate rendering into Russian requires the following steps:\n\n- Retain the proper name “Hardy” in its conventional Cyrillic form “Харди”.\n- Render the predicate “was born” as the masculine past-tense verb “родился”.\n- Express the year with the obligatory Russian construction “в 1925 году”.\n- Translate the descriptive phrase “English resort town” as the adjective-noun group “английском курортном городе”, placing both adjectives in the prepositional case to agree with “городе”.\n- Place the toponym “Cheltenham” in the prepositional case required by the preposition “в”, yielding “Челтенхеме”.\n\nCombining these elements produces the grammatically correct and stylistically natural Russian sentence:\n\nХарди родился в 1925 году в английском курортном городе Челтенхеме.\n\n\\boxed{Харди родился в 1925 г. в англ. курортном городе Челтенхеме.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":166,"output_tokens":224},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001452,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_740","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAnd in Kentucky, Gov. Matt Bevin (R) also got a visit from the ACLU over his use of Facebook and Twitter.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Und in Kentucky erhielt auch Gouverneur Matt Bevin (R) einen Besuch der ACLU wegen seiner Nutzung von Facebook und Twitter.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":55,"output_tokens":35}},"cost":2.815e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_273","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nPenny Dreadful actress Eva Green, Into the Badlands actor Marton Csokas and Robin Hood alum Eve Hewson are to star in the BBC's six-part drama, The Luminaries.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence contains several proper nouns (show titles, actor names, and production details) that are typically transliterated rather than translated when moving into Gujarati. The core predicate “are to star in” is rendered with the natural Gujarati construction “મુખ્ય ભૂમિકામાં હશે / અભિનય કરવાના છે.”  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the following Gujarati rendering:\n\nપેની ડ્રેડફુલ અભિનેત્રી ઈવા ગ્રીન, ઇન્ટુ ધ બેડલેન્ડ્સ અભિનેતા માર્ટન સોકાસ અને રોબિન હુડ એલમ ઈવ હ્યુસન બીબીસીના છ ભાગના ડ્રામા ધ લ્યુમિનેરીઝમાં મુખ્ય ભૂમિકામાં હશે.\n\n\\boxed{પેની ડ્રેડફુલ અભિનેત્રી ઈવા ગ્રીન, ઇન્ટુ ધ બેડલેન્ડ્સ અભિનેતા માર્ટન સોકાસ અને રોબિન હુડ એલમ ઈવ હ્યુસન બીબીસીના છ ભાગના ડ્રામા ધ લ્યુમિનેરીઝમાં મુખ્ય ભૂમિકામાં હશે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":190,"output_tokens":377},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002265,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_986","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nAustralia's Dan Bradman had scored 24 centuries in 66 innings of 43 Tests.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"ઑસ્ટ્રેલિયાના ડેન બ્રૅડમેને 43 ટેસ્ટમાં 66 ઇનિંગ્સમાં 24 સદીઓ બનાવી હતી.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{ઑસ્ટ્રેલિયાના ડેન બ્રૅડમેને 43 ટેસ્ટમાં 66 ઇનિંગ્સમાં 24 સદીઓ બનાવી હતી.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":51,"output_tokens":229}},"cost":0.00014403000000000002,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_199","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nAccording to the earlier IT Home report, Huawei will unveil the “best smartphone you’ve never heard of” in the afternoon of January 9 at the CES held in Las Vegas. The battery life of this model could support two days of continuous use.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"根据此前IT之家报道，华为将于1月9日下午在拉斯维加斯举行的CES上发布“你从未听说过的最好的智能手机”。这款机型的续航能力可支持连续使用两天。\n\n\\boxed{据此前IT之家报道，华为将于1月9日下午在拉斯维加斯举行的CES上发布“你从未听说过的最好的智能手机”。该机型续航可支持连续使用两天。\n}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":200,"output_tokens":85},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":8.25e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_222","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nFinance Finland (FFI) recommends that individuals working in investment services complete its APV1 or AVP2 qualifications.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Finance Finland (FFI) suosittelee, että sijoituspalveluissa toimivat henkilöt suorittavat sen APV1- tai AVP2-tutkinnon.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":52,"output_tokens":52}},"cost":3.7959999999999996e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_7","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nEntering Saturday's contest, Hurts completed 22 of 31 passes for 276 yards with four touchdowns and one interception in the Crimson Tide's first four games.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence describes a sports statistic for a quarterback (Jalen Hurts) ahead of a game. To translate it accurately into Gujarati, the proper names and technical terms are retained in their conventional transliterated forms, while the remainder of the sentence is rendered using standard Gujarati syntax and sports vocabulary:\n\n- “Entering Saturday’s contest” becomes “શનિવારની સ્પર્ધામાં દાખલ થતાં.”\n- The statistical clause “completed 22 of 31 passes for 276 yards with four touchdowns and one interception” is expressed as “276 યાર્ડ માટે ચાર ટચડાઉન અને એક ઇન્ટરસેપ્શન સાથે 31માંથી 22 પાસ પૂર્ણ કર્યા.”\n- The team reference “in the Crimson Tide’s first four games” is placed at the end for natural word order: “ક્રિમ્સન ટાઇડની પ્રથમ ચાર રમતોમાં.”\n\nCombining these elements yields the complete, idiomatic Gujarati sentence.\n\n\\boxed{શનિવારની સ્પર્ધામાં દાખલ થતાં, હર્ટ્સે ક્રિમ્સન ટાઇડની પ્રથમ ચાર રમતોમાં 276 યાર્ડ માટે ચાર ટચડાઉન અને એક ઇન્ટરસેપ્શન સાથે 31માંથી 22 પાસ પૂર્ણ કર્યા હતા.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":185,"output_tokens":385},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002295,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_393","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nWarren is a senior treasury assistant at Oxford University.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Warren ist ein leitender Assistent in der Kasse der Universität Oxford.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Warren ist ein leitender Assistent in der Kasse der Universität Oxford.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":39,"output_tokens":41}},"cost":2.967e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_589","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAntarctica: Gigantic iceberg drifts into the Antarctic\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Antarktis: Gigantischer Eisberg treibt in die Antarktis}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":41,"output_tokens":23}},"cost":1.9129999999999998e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_934","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nComedy director John Gordillo, 52, who was described as Shaquelle's \"unofficial stepfather,\" said: \"I know Shaquelle was still in contact with James Lyle, and he was based in New York at the time.\"\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"કોમેડી દિગ્દર્શક જ્યોન ગોર્ડિલો, 52, જેમને શાકેલના \"અનફોર્મલ સ્ટેપફાદર\" તરીકે વર્ણવવામાં આવ્યા હતા, તેમણે કહ્યું: \"મને ખબર છે કે શાકેલ હજુ પણ જેમ્સ લાઇલ સાથે સંપર્કમાં હતો, અને તે સમયે તે ન્યૂ યોર્કમાં રહેતો હતો.\"\n\n\\boxed{{કોમેડી દિગ્દર્શક જ્યોન ગોર્ડિલો, 52, જેમને શાકેલના \"અનફોર્મલ સ્ટેપફાદર\" તરીકે વર્ણવવામાં આવ્યા હતા, તેમણે કહ્યું: \"મને ખબર છે કે શાકેલ હજુ પણ જેમ્સ લાઇલ સાથે સંપર્કમાં હતો, અને તે સમયે તે ન્યૂ યોર્કમાં રહેતો હતો.\"}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":80,"output_tokens":613}},"cost":0.0003782,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-kk-en_467","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Kazakh.\n\nThe Middle East still contains multiple near-failed states, such as Iraq, Yemen, Libya, and Lebanon.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence can be rendered naturally in Kazakh by preserving its core meaning while using appropriate political terminology and standard country-name transliterations. “The Middle East” is conventionally translated as “Таяу Шығыс.” The phrase “near-failed states” is expressed by the compound “сәтсіздікке жақын … мемлекеттер,” which conveys the idea of states on the brink of failure. “Still contains multiple” becomes the concise “әлі де … бірнеше … бар,” and the list of examples is introduced with the postposition “сияқты.”  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent, idiomatic rendering  \n\nТаяу Шығыста әлі де Ирак, Йемен, Ливия және Ливан сияқты сәтсіздікке жақын бірнеше мемлекеттер бар.\n\n\\boxed{Таяу Шығыста әлі де Ирак, Йемен, Ливия, Ливан сияқты сәтсіздікке жақын бірнеше мемлекеттер бар.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":172,"output_tokens":227},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001479,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_252","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nDoyle remembers her first world championships, when the only other Scot in the team was Lee McConnell.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Doyle muistaa ensimmäiset maailmanmestaruuskilpailunsa, jolloin ainoa muu skottilainen joukkueessa oli Lee McConnell.\n\n\\boxed{Doyle muistaa ensimmäiset maailmanmestaruuskilpailunsa, jolloin ainoa muu skottilainen joukkueessa oli Lee McConnell.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":48,"output_tokens":87}},"cost":5.8439999999999996e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_737","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nRelevant data revealed that the global aerospace industry will grow by a rapid 6% to 7% each year. By 2020, China’s aerospace market will amount to RMB800 billion.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The translation must preserve the original meaning, tone, and numerical details while producing natural, idiomatic Chinese.  \n\n- “Relevant data revealed that …” is conventionally rendered in Chinese business or technical prose as “相关数据显示 …”.  \n- “Global aerospace industry” is rendered “全球航空航天产业”.  \n- The phrase “grow by a rapid 6 % to 7 % each year” is re-ordered for fluency into “以每年 6 % 至 7 % 的速度快速增长”.  \n- “By 2020” becomes the standard time-expression “到 2020 年”.  \n- “China’s aerospace market will amount to RMB 800 billion” is expressed as “中国航空航天市场规模将达到 8000 亿元人民币”, converting “800 billion” correctly into the Chinese numeral system (8000 亿元) and adding the currency unit for clarity.  \n\nCombining these choices yields a concise, accurate two-sentence translation that mirrors the source structure and register.\n\n\\boxed{相关数据显示，全球航空航天产业将以每年6%至7%的速度快速增长。到2020年，中国航空航天市场规模将达8000亿元人民币。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":189,"output_tokens":237},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001563,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_930","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nYouTube, Facebook and WhatsApp services will be available in the Jio feature phone.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"YouTube, Facebook અને WhatsApp સેવાઓ જીઓ ફીચર ફોનમાં ઉપલબ્ધ થશે.\n\n\\boxed{યુટ્યુબ, ફેસબુક અને વોટ્સએપ સેવાઓ જીઓ ફીચર ફોનમાં ઉપલબ્ધ થશે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":170,"output_tokens":96},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":8.2e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_72","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nCivil rights group issues travel warning for Missouri\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Skupina za občanská práva vydala cestovní varování pro Missouri\n\n\\boxed{Skupina za občanská práva vydala cestovní varování pro Missouri}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":39,"output_tokens":50}},"cost":3.507e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_449","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nLow-carbs with high fat and protein are consumed in the Keto Diet.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence describes foods that are low in carbohydrates but high in fats and proteins, as consumed in the Keto diet. A natural Gujarati rendering therefore begins with the diet name itself (“કીટો ડાયેટમાં”), followed by the nutritional profile expressed with the conventional terms “ઓછા કાર્બ્સ,” “વધુ ચરબી,” and “પ્રોટીન.” The verb phrase “are consumed” is idiomatically rendered by the formal construction “સેવન કરવામાં આવે છે,” which is the standard way to express dietary intake in Gujarati.  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent translation  \nકીટો ડાયેટમાં ઓછા કાર્બ્સ, વધુ ચરબી અને પ્રોટીનનું સેવન કરવામાં આવે છે.\n\n\\boxed{કીટો ડાયેટમાં ઓછા કાર્બ્સ, વધુ ચરબી અને પ્રોટીનનું સેવન કરવામાં આવે છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":167,"output_tokens":260},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001634,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_883","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nMcVitie's owner Pladis said it had invested more than £5m at the site in the last few years.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Der Eigentümer von McVitie's, Pladis, sagte, er habe in den letzten Jahren mehr als 5 Mio. £ am Standort investiert.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":55,"output_tokens":43}},"cost":3.295e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_59","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nMissouri recorded 100 hate crimes in 2015, according to the latest figures from the FBI's hate crime reporting program, ranking the state at 16th in the country in terms of the number of such violations.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"根据联邦调查局仇恨犯罪报告项目的最新数据，密苏里州2015年记录了100起仇恨犯罪，在全国此类犯罪数量排名中位列第16位。\n\n\\boxed{根据FBI仇恨犯罪报告项目的最新数据，密苏里州2015年记录了100起仇恨犯罪，在全国此类犯罪数量排名中位列第16位。\n}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":195,"output_tokens":81},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":7.950000000000001e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_196","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nThree companies from Mainland China made the 2011 Top 50 list. In addition 2nd place PetroChina, Sinopec and CNOOC were ranked 9th and 15th, respectively.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"中国大陆有三家公司进入2011年Top 50榜单。此外，位列第二的中国石油、中国石化和中海油分别排名第9和第15。\n\nThe original text consists of two sentences that must be rendered accurately while preserving meaning, company names, and ranking information.  \n\n- The first sentence states that three mainland Chinese firms appeared on the 2011 Top-50 list; the natural Chinese equivalent is “中国大陆有三家公司进入2011年Top 50榜单.”  \n- The second sentence identifies the three firms—PetroChina (rank 2 overall), Sinopec (rank 9) and CNOOC (rank 15). Standard Chinese renderings of the company names are 中国石油、中国石化和中海油; the ranking clause is expressed with the adverb 分别 to convey “respectively.”  \n\nCombining the two parts yields a concise, idiomatic translation that retains all factual content and the original sentence structure.\n\n\\boxed{中国大陆有三家公司进入2011 Top 50榜单。此外，位列第二的中国石油、中国石化和中海油分别排名第9和第15。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":192,"output_tokens":230},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.00015340000000000002,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_776","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nGuillermo Mordillo was born on 4th August 1932 in Buenos Aires, the son of a Spanish immigrant.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Guillermo Mordillo wurde am 4. August 1932 in Buenos Aires geboren, der Sohn eines spanischen Einwanderers.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":57,"output_tokens":38}},"cost":3.0210000000000004e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_122","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nPhilip Steele is the membership secretary of the Ulster Lambretta Club which currently has 97 members.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"ફિલિપ સ્ટીલ અલ્સ્ટર લેમ્બ્રેટા ક્લબના સભ્યપદના સેક્રેટરી છે, જેમાં હાલ 97 સભ્યો છે.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{ફિલિપ સ્ટીલ અલ્સ્ટર લેમ્બ્રેટા ક્લબના સભ્યપદના સેક્રેટરી છે, જેમાં હાલ 97 સભ્યો છે.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":51,"output_tokens":267}},"cost":0.00016683,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_404","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\n\"According to our estimations, 167 lung cancer deaths a year can be attributed to passive smoking,\" said study leader Heiko Becher.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"„Laut unseren Schätzungen können jährlich 167 Lungenkrebstote auf das Passivrauchen zurückgeführt werden“, sagte Studienleiter Heiko Becher.\n\n\\boxed{„Laut unseren Schätzungen können jährlich 167 Lungenkrebstote auf das Passivrauchen zurückgeführt werden“, sagte Studienleiter Heiko Becher.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":59,"output_tokens":84}},"cost":5.807e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_330","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nAccording to a 2015 RAND study, DoD reimbursement rates do not include the cost of personnel, but do account for fuel, maintenance, and contracting costs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Podle studie RAND z roku 2015 sazby pro náhradu nákladů Ministerstva obrany nezahrnují náklady na personál, ale zahrnují náklady na palivo, údržbu a smlouvy.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Podle studie RAND z roku 2015 sazby pro náhradu nákladů Ministerstva obrany nezahrnují náklady na personál, ale zahrnují náklady na palivo, údržbu a smlouvy.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":65,"output_tokens":145}},"cost":9.545e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_252","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nFor nearly a decade, Cassandra Greene has directed the annual reenactment of the Moore's Ford Bridge lynchings.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"近十年来，卡桑德拉·格林一直导演着摩尔福特桥私刑事件的年度重演。\n\nThe translation preserves the original sentence’s present-perfect aspect (“has directed”) by using the durative adverbial “一直,” which signals an action continuing up to the present.  \n- “For nearly a decade” is rendered as the conventional time adverbial “近十年来.”  \n- Proper names are transliterated according to standard Mandarin conventions: “Cassandra Greene” → “卡桑德拉·格林,” “Moore’s Ford Bridge” → “摩尔福特桥.”  \n- The historical term “lynchings” is conveyed by the established Chinese phrase “私刑事件.”  \n- “Annual reenactment” is translated directly as “年度重演,” maintaining both the frequency and the performative nuance of the English noun phrase.  \n\nThe resulting Chinese sentence is grammatically natural, semantically faithful, and stylistically neutral.\n\n\\boxed{近十年来，卡桑德拉·格林一直导演着摩尔福特桥私刑事件的年度重演。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":174,"output_tokens":225},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001473,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_976","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe U.S. Environmental Protection Agency reversed a decision to delay an Obama-era rule requiring states to curb smog-causing emissions, one day after 15 states sued the agency over the move.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Americká agentura pro ochranu životního prostředí obrátila rozhodnutí odkládat pravidlo z dob vlády Obamy, které vyžaduje, aby státy omezily emise způsobující smog, a to den poté, co proti agentuře žalovalo 15 států kvůli tomuto kroku.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":70,"output_tokens":106}},"cost":7.27e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_542","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe AfD event lasts a little more than an hour; the guests in the forecourt have a long wind, but even there it is time to clear up shortly after 9pm.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Die AfD-Veranstaltung dauert etwas über eine Stunde; die Gäste auf dem Vorplatz haben viel zu sagen, doch auch dort ist es kurz nach 21 Uhr Zeit, sich zu zerstreuen.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Die AfD-Veranstaltung dauert etwas über eine Stunde; die Gäste auf dem Vorplatz haben viel zu sagen, doch auch dort ist es kurz nach 21 Uhr Zeit, sich zu zerstreuen.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":66,"output_tokens":97}},"cost":6.678e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_878","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nLeft in their dust was a battered Woods, the 14-times major winner being drubbed three times, with Patrick Reed brushed aside twice.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence refers to a golf context (Tiger Woods being outperformed), which informs word choice for terms like “major winner,” “drubbed,” and “brushed aside.”  \n\nA natural Gujarati rendering preserves the inverted subject-verb order while using idiomatic expressions:  \n- “Left in their dust” → તેમની ધૂળમાં છોડી દેવામાં આવ્યા  \n- “battered Woods” → થાકેલા વુડ્સ  \n- “14-times major winner” → 14 વખતના મેજર વિજેતા  \n- “drubbed three times” → ત્રણ વખત હાર્યા  \n- “brushed aside twice” → બે વખત બાજુમાં ધકેલી દેવામાં આવ્યા  \n\nPutting these together yields the fluent translation below.\n\n\\boxed{તેમની ધૂળમાં છોડી દેવામાં આવ્યા થાકેલા વુડ્સ, 14 વખતના મેજર વિજેતા ત્રણ વખત હાર્યા, પેટ્રિક રીડને બે વખત બાજુમાં ધકેલી દેવામાં આવ્યા.}\n\n}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":181,"output_tokens":318},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001952,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_663","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nThe Afghan Independent Election Commission reports 1.2 million women are registered out of 3.6 million total registered voters.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence translates naturally into Chinese as follows:\n\n- \"The Afghan Independent Election Commission\" is rendered as the standard proper name \"阿富汗独立选举委员会\".\n- \"reports\" is expressed with the neutral reporting verb \"报告称\".\n- The numerical clause is converted using the conventional Chinese counting word \"万\" (120万 for 1.2 million, 360万 for 3.6 million) and is re-ordered for idiomatic flow while preserving the original meaning of \"women registered out of total registered voters.\"\n\nThe resulting full sentence therefore reads:  \n阿富汗独立选举委员会报告称，在360万登记选民总数中，有120万女性已登记。\n\n\\boxed{阿富汗独立选举委员会报告称，在360万登记选民中，有120万女性已登记。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":175,"output_tokens":162},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.000116,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_434","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nPer a new NCAA rule this season, a player can appear in as many as four games and still qualify for a redshirt season.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence concerns an NCAA sports eligibility rule (redshirting), so the translation must preserve the factual meaning while rendering sports terminology naturally in Gujarati.  \n\n- “Per a new NCAA rule this season” becomes “આ સીઝનના નવા એનસીએએ નિયમ અનુસાર”.  \n- “A player can appear in as many as four games” is rendered “એક ખેલાડી ચાર રમતો સુધી ભાગ લઈ શકે છે”.  \n- “And still qualify for a redshirt season” is expressed “અને તેમ છતાં રેડશર્ટ સીઝન માટે લાયક ઠરી શકે છે”, keeping the English term “રેડશર્ટ” in transliterated form because it is a technical sports concept without a standard Gujarati equivalent.  \n\nPutting the clauses together yields a fluent, accurate Gujarati sentence that retains the original intent and register.\n\n\\boxed{આ સીઝનના નવા NCAA નિયમ અનુસાર, એક ખેલાડી ચાર રમતો સુધી ભાગ લઈ શકે છે અને તેમ છતાં રેડશર્ટ સીઝન માટે લાયક ઠરી શકે છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":179,"output_tokens":332},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002018,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_1","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nPeople living and registered with a GP in England will also be able to enrol for potential participation at their local participating sexual health clinic.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Englannissa asuvat ja terveydenhuoltotoimistoon rekisteröidyt ihmiset voivat myös ilmoittautua mahdolliseen osallistumiseen paikallisessa mukana olevassa seksuaaliterveysklinikalla.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Englannissa asuvat ja terveydenhuoltotoimistoon rekisteröidyt ihmiset voivat myös ilmoittautua mahdolliseen osallistumiseen paikallisessa mukana olevassa seksuaaliterveysklinikalla.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":54,"output_tokens":135}},"cost":8.802e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_446","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nHMX-1 crews frequently perform training flights around the Washington area and at the South Lawn to practice depositing the President of the United States at the White House with inches of precision.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Posádky HMX-1 často provádějí cvičné lety v okolí Washingtonu a na Jižní trávník, aby si procvičily přesné přistání prezidenta Spojených států u Bílého domu s přesností na palec.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Posádky HMX-1 často provádějí cvičné lety v okolí Washingtonu a na Jižní trávník, aby si procvičily přesné přistání prezidenta Spojených států u Bílého domu s přesností na palec.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":67,"output_tokens":157}},"cost":0.00010291,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_95","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nHow and from when are customers being notified of updates?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence is a question about the method and starting point of customer notifications regarding updates. A direct and natural German translation preserves the interrogative structure while using standard phrasing:\n\n- \"How\" translates as \"Wie\".\n- \"And from when\" translates as \"und ab wann\" (using \"ab wann\" to indicate the starting point of the notifications).\n- \"Are customers being notified\" translates as \"werden Kunden benachrichtigt\" (passive voice in present continuous, inverted for the question form).\n- \"Of updates\" translates as \"über Updates\" (\"Updates\" is commonly retained in German technical contexts; \"Aktualisierungen\" is an equivalent alternative).\n\nCombining these yields the grammatically correct German question \"Wie und ab wann werden Kunden über Updates benachrichtigt?\".\n\n\\boxed{Wie und ab wann werden Kunden über Updates benachrichtigt?}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":161,"output_tokens":178},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001212,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_354","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nWarren has long been considered a potential 2020 Democratic presidential nominee to take on President Donald Trump.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"વૉરેનને લાંબા સમયથી રાષ્ટ્રપતિ ડોનાલ્ડ ટ્રમ્પને પડકારવા માટે 2020 ડેમોક્રેટિક રાષ્ટ્રપતિ ઉમેદવાર તરીકે ગણવામાં આવી રહ્યો છે. \\boxed{{}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":52,"output_tokens":187}},"cost":0.00011896,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_636","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nRedshirt season no longer a possibility for Alabama's Hurts\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence is a sports headline referring to the NCAA concept of redshirting (sitting out a season to preserve eligibility). In Lithuanian sports terminology this is rendered as “raudonojo marškinėlio sezonas.”\n\nA natural, idiomatic translation therefore reads:\n\n“Alabamos Hurtsui raudonojo marškinėlio sezonas nebėra galimas.”\n\n(The proper noun “Hurts” remains unchanged, the possessive “Alabama’s” becomes the Lithuanian dative “Alabamos … -ui,” and “no longer a possibility” is expressed concisely by “nebėra galimas.”)\n\n\\boxed{Alabamos Hurtsui raud. marškinėlio sezonas nebėra galimas}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":163,"output_tokens":151},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001081,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_146","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nA Michigan man suspected of murdering his girlfriend has been arrested after leading police on a chase that ended when he was mowed down by a police car.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence describes a news event involving a suspect from Michigan. To translate it into Gujarati, break the sentence into its core semantic units and render each one idiomatically while preserving the original meaning, tense, and narrative flow:\n\n- “A Michigan man suspected of murdering his girlfriend” becomes “તેની પ્રેમિકાની હત્યાના શંકાસ્પદ મિશિગનના એક માણસને”.  \n- “has been arrested after leading police on a chase” becomes “પોલીસને પીછો આપ્યા બાદ ધરપકડ કરવામાં આવી છે”.  \n- “that ended when he was mowed down by a police car” becomes “જે અંતમાં ત્યારે આવ્યો જ્યારે તેને પોલીસની કાર દ્વારા ઢેર કરી દેવામાં આવ્યો”.\n\nConcatenating these units yields a single, grammatically coherent Gujarati sentence that mirrors the original structure and register.\n\n\\boxed{તેની પ્રેમિકાની હત્યાના શંકાસ્પદ મિશિગનના એક માણસને પોલીસને પીછો આપ્યા બાદ ધરપકડ કરવામાં આવી છે જે અંતમાં ત્યારે આવ્યો જ્યારે તેને પોલીસની કાર દ્વારા ઢેર કરી દેવામાં આવ્યો.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":182,"output_tokens":386},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002294,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_572","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nThe creatures were around 18 feet (five metres) long on average, and weighted up to 3,000 pounds (1,300 kg).\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The creatures were around 18 feet (five metres) long on average, and weighed up to 3,000 pounds (1,300 kg).\n\n这些生物平均身长约18英尺（5米），体重可达3000磅（1300公斤）。\n\n\\boxed{这些生物平均身长约18英尺（5米），体重可达3000磅（1300公斤）。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":180,"output_tokens":83},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":7.75e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_198","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nThis sandal has been made in collaboration by UAE brand Jada Dubai and Passion Jewellers.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence can be segmented for translation as follows:\n\n- “This sandal” → “આ સેન્ડલ” (retaining the English noun “સેન્ડલ,” which is conventional in Gujarati fashion contexts).  \n- “has been made” → “બનાવવામાં આવ્યું છે” (passive perfective construction).  \n- “in collaboration by” → “સહયોગથી” (instrumental case expressing joint production).  \n- “UAE brand Jada Dubai” → “UAE બ્રાન્ડ જાદા દુબઈ” (proper name and country abbreviation left unchanged).  \n- “and Passion Jewellers” → “અને પેશન જ્યુએલર્સ” (likewise retaining the brand name).\n\nConcatenating these segments while preserving Gujarati word order and subject–verb agreement yields the single, idiomatic sentence  \n\nઆ સેન્ડલ UAE બ્રાન્ડ જાદા દુબઈ અને પેશન જ્યુએલર્સના સહયોગથી બનાવવામાં આવ્યું છે.\n\n\\boxed{આ સેન્ડલ UAE બ્રાન્ડ જાદા દુબઈ અને પેશન જ્યુએલર્સના સહયોગથી બનાવવામાં આવ્યું છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":170,"output_tokens":325},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001965,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_503","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nAccording to the latest national fitness survey bulletin issued in 2014, the number of exercisers has increased by nearly 8 percent points compared with 2007.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"根据2014年发布的最新全国健身调查公报，与2007年相比，锻炼人数增加了近8个百分点。\n\n\\boxed{根据2014年发布的最新全国健身调查公报，与2007年相比，锻炼人数增加了近8个百分点。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":183,"output_tokens":52},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":6.26e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_101","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nEven if these researchers do not attribute the break-off of this gigantic iceberg to climate change, nevertheless, very many ice shelfs in the Antarctic Peninsula have crumbled in recent decades.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Auch wenn diese Forscher den Abbruch dieses gigantischen Eisbergs nicht dem Klimawandel zuschreiben, so sind doch in den letzten Jahrzehnten sehr viele Schelfeisgebiete auf der Antarktischen Halbinsel zerbrochen.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":64,"output_tokens":63}},"cost":4.612e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_83","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nFrancesco Molinari fittingly took the glory as Europe regained the Ryder Cup in dominant style on Sunday, the Italian beating Phil Mickelson on the 16th to post the point needed to reach the magic tally of 14.5.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence describes a golfing achievement in the Ryder Cup, so the translation must preserve proper names (e.g., Francesco Molinari, Ryder Cup, Phil Mickelson) while rendering the narrative flow, temporal clause (“on Sunday”), and the decisive sporting action into natural Gujarati.\n\n- Retain English proper nouns in Gujarati script.  \n- Translate “fittingly took the glory” as “યોગ્ય રીતે ગૌરવ મેળવ્યું.”  \n- Render the subordinate clause “as Europe regained the Ryder Cup in dominant style on Sunday” as “રવિવારે યુરોપે પ્રભાવશાળી રીતે રાયડર કપ પાછો મેળવ્યો.”  \n- Convert the participial phrase “the Italian beating Phil Mickelson on the 16th” into a finite clause “ઇટાલિયન ફિલ મિકેલસનને 16માં હરાવીને.”  \n- Express the purpose/result “to post the point needed to reach the magic tally of 14.5” as “14.5ના જાદુઈ આંકડા સુધી પહોંચવા જરૂરી પોઇન્ટ મેળવ્યો.”\n\nConcatenating these segments yields a single, idiomatic Gujarati sentence that maintains the original meaning and sports context.\n\n\\boxed{રવિવારે યુરોપે પ્રભાવશાળી રીતે રાયડર કપ પાછો મેળવ્યો ત્યારે ફ્રાન્ચેસ્કો મોલિનારીએ યોગ્ય રીતે ગૌરવ મેળવ્યું, ઇટાલિયન ફિલ મિકેલસનને 16માં હરાવીને 14.5ના જાદુઈ આંકડા સુધી પહોંચવા જરૂરી પોઇન્ટ મેળવ્યો.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":199,"output_tokens":485},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.00028230000000000003,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_774","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nMany joined the Free Papua Movement (OPM), the rebel army that claims to defend the rights of the Papuans by launching sporadic attacks and kidnapping raids on Indonesian soldiers.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence must be rendered into natural, idiomatic German while preserving the original meaning, tense, and structure.  \n\n- “Many joined …” becomes “Viele schlossen sich … an”.  \n- The proper name “Free Papua Movement (OPM)” is conventionally rendered in German as “Freien Papua-Bewegung (OPM)”.  \n- “the rebel army that claims …” is translated as the appositive “der Rebellenarmee, die behauptet …”, keeping the present tense of “claims”.  \n- “by launching sporadic attacks and kidnapping raids on …” is expressed with the participial construction “indem sie … durchführt”, using the established compounds “sporadische Angriffe” and “Entführungsüberfälle”.  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the following translation:  \n\nViele schlossen sich der Freien Papua-Bewegung (OPM) an, der Rebellenarmee, die behauptet, die Rechte der Papuas zu verteidigen, indem sie sporadische Angriffe und Entführungsüberfälle auf indonesische Soldaten durchführt.\n\n\\boxed{Viele schlossen sich der Freien Papua-Bewegung (OPM) an, der Rebellenarmee, die behauptet, die Rechte der Papuas zu verteidigen, indem sie sporadische Angriffe u. Entführungsüberfälle auf indon. Soldaten durchführt.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":185,"output_tokens":294},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.000184,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_247","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe world football association, FIFA, is organising the first \"Interactive Club World Cup\" this coming weekend in London, which will see gamers from different clubs compete against each other.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{\\text{Der Weltfußballverband FIFA veranstaltet am kommenden Wochenende in London die erste „Interaktive Club-Weltmeisterschaft“, bei der Gamer von verschiedenen Vereinen gegeneinander antreten werden.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":63,"output_tokens":53}},"cost":3.999e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_154","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nIt used the app developed for Pebble to quickly go live on Apple's new product.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence describes a subject leveraging a pre-existing app (originally built for the Pebble smartwatch platform) in order to launch rapidly on a new Apple device.  \n\nA natural Gujarati rendering preserves this causal structure while respecting Gujarati word order, gender agreement (“એપ” is treated as feminine, hence “વિકસાવેલી”), and conventional transliterations of the proper nouns “Pebble” and “Apple.”  \n\nThe resulting translation is:  \nતેણે પેબલ માટે વિકસાવેલી એપનો ઉપયોગ કરીને એપલના નવા ઉત્પાદન પર ઝડપથી લાઇવ થઈ ગયું.\n\n\\boxed{તેણે પેબલ માટે વિકસાવેલી એપનો ઉપયોગ કરીને એપલના નવા ઉત્પાદન પર ઝડપથી લાઇવ થઈ ગયું.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":169,"output_tokens":252},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001598,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_17","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe resulting smog can cause serious breathing problems among sensitive groups of people, contributing to thousands of premature deaths each year.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The resulting smog can cause serious breathing problems among sensitive groups of people, contributing to thousands of premature deaths each year.\n\nA natural and accurate German translation is:\n\nDer entstehende Smog kann bei empfindlichen Personengruppen ernsthafte Atemprobleme verursachen und trägt so zu Tausenden von vorzeitigen Todesfällen pro Jahr bei.\n\nThis rendering preserves the original meaning, uses standard environmental/health terminology in German (e.g., “Atemprobleme,” “empfindliche Personengruppen,” “vorzeitige Todesfälle”), and maintains grammatical correctness and fluency.\n\n\\boxed{Der entstehende Smog kann bei empfindl. Personengruppen ernsthafte Atemprobleme verursachen u. trägt so zu Tausenden vorzeit. Todesfällen/Jahr bei.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":173,"output_tokens":168},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001186,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_655","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\n72-year-old Fidelity bets on the future with blockchain, virtual reality and AI\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"72 metų amžiaus „Fidelity“ stato į ateitį su blockchain, virtualia realybe ir dirbtiniu intelektu\n\n\\boxed{{72 metų amžiaus „Fidelity“ stato į ateitį su blockchain, virtualia realybe ir dirbtiniu intelektu}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":48,"output_tokens":75}},"cost":5.1240000000000004e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_257","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nNASA is considering firing atmospheric gases to reduce the speed of the debris so that it would de-orbit. Europe is looking at launching a satellite with a large net to capture the debris and it back to earth. Japan’s idea is to use a power chain to capture the debris.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"美国国家航空航天局正在考虑释放大气气体以降低碎片的速度，使其脱离轨道。欧洲则计划发射一颗带有大型网的卫星，用以捕获碎片并将其带回地球。日本的想法是使用一条电力链来捕获碎片。\n\n\\boxed{美国国家航空航天局正在考虑释放大气气体以降低碎片的速度，使其脱离轨道。欧洲则计划发射一颗带有大型网的卫星，用以捕获碎片并将其带回地球。日本的想法是使用一条电力链来捕获碎片。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":84,"output_tokens":106}},"cost":7.452e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_361","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nSelf-Publishing 2.0 was selling e-books for e-readers and phones via online bookstores.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"સેલ્ફ-પબ્લિશિંગ 2.0 ઓનલાઇન બુકસ્ટોર્સ દ્વારા ઇ-રીડર્સ અને ફોન માટે ઇ-બુક્સ વેચી રહ્યું હતું.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{સેલ્ફ-પબ્લિશિંગ 2.0 ઓનલાઇન બુકસ્ટોર્સ દ્વારા ઇ-રીડર્સ અને ફોન માટે ઇ-બુક્સ વેચી રહ્યું હતું.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":52,"output_tokens":162}},"cost":0.00010396,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_667","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nSome speakers asked the audience to call their Congress members to react to this week's Senate hearings for Supreme Court nominee Brett Kavanaugh.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence can be segmented for translation as follows:\n\n- “Some speakers” → કેટલાક વક્તાઓ  \n- “asked the audience” → પ્રેક્ષકોને કહ્યું  \n- “to call their Congress members” → તેમના કૉંગ્રેસ સભ્યોને ફોન કરવા  \n- “to react to this week’s Senate hearings” → આ અઠવાડિયાની સેનેટ સુનાવણીઓ પર પ્રતિક્રિયા આપવા  \n- “for Supreme Court nominee Brett Kavanaugh” → સર્વોચ્ચ અદાલતના નામાંકિત બ્રેટ કાવાનાફ માટે  \n\nThese segments are then assembled into a single, grammatically natural Gujarati sentence while preserving the original meaning and word order as closely as possible. Proper nouns (Brett Kavanaugh, Congress, Senate, Supreme Court) are rendered by standard transliteration conventions used in Gujarati media.\n\nકેટલાક વક્તાઓએ પ્રેક્ષકોને આ અઠવાડિયાની સુપ્રીમ કોર્ટના નામાંકિત બ્રેટ કાવાનાફ માટેની સેનેટ સુનાવણીઓ પર પ્રતિક્રિયા આપવા તેમના કૉંગ્રેસ સભ્યોને ફોન કરવા કહ્યું.\n\n\\boxed{કેટલાક વક્તાઓએ પ્રેક્ષકોને આ અઠવાડિયાની સુપ્રીમ કોર્ટના નામાંકિત બ્રેટ કાવાનાફ માટેની સેનેટ સુનાવણીઓ પર પ્રતિક્રિયા આપવા તેમના કૉંગ્રેસ સભ્યોને ફોન કરવા કહ્યું.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":177,"output_tokens":501},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0002859,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_44","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe chair of the Loudoun County Board of Supervisors violated the First Amendment, according to U.S. District Judge James C. Cacheris in Alexandria, when she banned a constituent from her Facebook page.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Der Vorsitzende des Loudoun County Board of Supervisors verletzte laut US-Bundesrichter James C. Cacheris in Alexandria die erste Änderung, als er eine Wählerin von ihrer Facebook-Seite ausschloss.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":70,"output_tokens":57}},"cost":4.3299999999999995e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_848","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nLullaby Trust acts as an expert for health authorities in the UK in terms of a safe night's sleep for children.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Lullaby Trust toimii asiantuntijana terveysviranomaisille Yhdistyneessä kuningaskunnassa lasten turvallisen yöunen osalta.\n\n\\boxed{Lullaby Trust toimii asiantuntijana terveysviranomaisille Yhdistyneessä kuningaskunnassa lasten turvallisen yöunen osalta.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":53,"output_tokens":89}},"cost":6.029e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_887","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nGerman researchers, experimenting on mice, have found that the immune system, in addition to playing a defensive role, could also assist in the formation of cancer.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence can be translated by breaking it down into its core components and rendering them naturally in Chinese while preserving the original meaning, structure, and scientific tone:\n\n- “German researchers” becomes “德国研究人员”.\n- The participial phrase “experimenting on mice” is rendered as “通过在小鼠身上进行实验” (or the more concise “在小鼠实验中”), which smoothly integrates the experimental context.\n- “have found that” is expressed by the standard reporting verb “发现”.\n- “the immune system” is the direct term “免疫系统”.\n- “in addition to playing a defensive role” is translated as “除了发挥防御作用之外”, keeping the concessive structure.\n- “could also assist in the formation of cancer” is conveyed by “还可能协助癌症的形成”, matching the modal nuance and the verb “assist”.\n\nCombining these elements yields the fluent, accurate Chinese sentence  \n“德国研究人员通过在小鼠身上进行实验发现，免疫系统除了发挥防御作用之外，还可能协助癌症的形成。”\n\n\\boxed{德国研究人员通过在小鼠身上进行实验发现，免疫系统除了发挥防御作用之外，还可能协助癌症的形成。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":181,"output_tokens":240},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001562,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_754","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nAfter Garcia's victory by unanimous decision over former four-division world champion Adrien Broner on Saturday on Showtime, both fighters are members of the top-five pound-for-pound list.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence concerns a boxing match, so boxing terminology must be rendered naturally in Finnish while preserving the original meaning and sentence structure. Key terms are translated as follows:\n\n- “Garcia’s victory by unanimous decision” becomes “Garcian voitettua … yksimielisellä päätöksellä” (the participial construction mirrors the English “after” clause).  \n- “Former four-division world champion” is rendered “entisen neljän painoluokan maailmanmestarin”.  \n- “On Saturday on Showtime” stays close to the original: “lauantaina Showtimessa”.  \n- “Both fighters are members of the top-five pound-for-pound list” is expressed as “molemmat ottelijat kuuluvat viiden parhaan joukkoon pound-for-pound-listalla”, keeping the conventional English term “pound-for-pound” that is universally used in Finnish boxing commentary.\n\nCombining these elements yields a single, idiomatic Finnish sentence that retains the original information and word order as closely as possible.\n\n\\boxed{Garcian voitettua ent. 4 painoluokan mm Adrien Bronerin yksimielisellä päätöksellä lauantaina Showtimessa, molemmat ottelijat kuuluvat top-5 pound-for-pound -listalle.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":185,"output_tokens":253},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001635,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_5","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAs the company points out, however, the TSA guidelines are somewhat complicated and confusing.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Wie das Unternehmen jedoch hervorhebt, sind die TSA-Richtlinien etwas kompliziert und verwirrend.\n\n\\boxed{{Wie das Unternehmen jedoch hervorhebt, sind die TSA-Richtlinien etwas kompliziert und verwirrend.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":45,"output_tokens":58}},"cost":4.065e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_578","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nLess than eight months after acquiring Dongfeng Nanchong Automobile Co., Ltd., Geely Holding Group’s (hereinafter referred to “Geely Group”) brand new commercial vehicle brand “Yuan Cheng” made its debut on October 26. Yuan Cheng E200, Geely Group's first pure electric light truck equipped with a smart auto networking platform premiered at WCIF.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"继收购南充东风汽车有限公司不到八个月后，吉利控股集团（以下简称“吉利集团”）的全新商用车品牌“远程”于10月26日首次亮相。吉利集团首款配备智能车联网平台的纯电动轻卡远程E200在世界客货运输大会上首次发布。\n\n\\boxed{{继收购南充东风汽车有限公司不到八个月后，吉利控股集团（以下简称“吉利集团”）的全新商用车品牌“远程”于10月26日首次亮相。吉利集团首款配备智能车联网平台的纯电动轻卡远程E200在世界客货运输大会上首次发布。}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":121,"output_tokens":201}},"cost":0.00013633,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_805","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nVon Hagens rose to fame in the UK when he performed a live autopsy on British television, the first public autopsy for 170 years.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"વૉન હેગન્સ બ્રિટિશ ટેલિવિઝન પર લાઇવ ઓટોપ્સી કરીને યુકેમાં પ્રખ્યાત થયો, જે 170 વર્ષમાં પ્રથમ જાહેર ઓટોપ્સી હતી.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{વૉન હેગન્સ બ્રિટિશ ટેલિવિઝન પર લાઇવ ઓટોપ્સી કરીને યુકેમાં પ્રખ્યાત થયો, જે 170 વર્ષમાં પ્રથમ જાહેર ઓટોપ્સી હતી.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":60,"output_tokens":333}},"cost":0.00020759999999999998,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_998","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nDespite Mr Johnson wooing the grass roots with his hardline approach to Brexit, the brutal assessment from former trade minister Digby Jones went down well with members at conference in Birmingham this afternoon.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"જોહનસન સાહેબે બ્રેક્ઝિટ માટે કડક વલણ અપનાવીને સામાન્ય લોકોને આકર્ષિત કર્યા હોવા છતાં, પૂર્વ વેપાર મંત્રી ડિગબી જોન્સનું કરકસરભર્યું મૂલ્યાંકન આજે બર્મિંગહામમાં યોજાયેલા કોન્ફરન્સમાં સભ્યોને ગમ્યું.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{જોહનસન સાહેબે બ્રેક્ઝિટ માટે કડક વલણ અપનાવીને સામાન્ય લોકોને આકર્ષિત કર્યા હોવા છતાં, પૂર્વ વેપાર મંત્રી ડિગબી જોન્સનું કરકસરભર્યું મૂલ્યાંકન આજે બર્મિંગહામમાં યોજાયેલા કોન્ફરન્સમાં સભ્યોને ગમ્યું.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":67,"output_tokens":611}},"cost":0.00037530999999999996,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_573","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nThe Xinjiang Cultural Exchange Delegation has visited the United States and Canada in recent days. During their stay in the two countries, they held several forums with local academics, media professionals and overseas Chinese,\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The given English sentence can be translated into Chinese as follows:\n\n新疆文化交流代表团近日访问了美国和加拿大。在两国逗留期间，他们与当地学者、媒体人士和海外华人举行了多次论坛，\n\nThis rendering preserves the original meaning, structure, and tone while using natural Chinese phrasing (e.g., “近日” for “in recent days,” “逗留期间” for “during their stay,” and “举行了多次论坛” for “held several forums”). The translation is kept literal where appropriate to avoid adding or omitting information, and the trailing comma is retained to match the source text exactly.\n\n\\boxed{新疆文化交流代表团近日访美加。在两国逗留期间，他们与当地学者、媒体人士和海外华人举行了多次论坛，}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":188,"output_tokens":157},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001161,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_680","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nOne of the children is almost three years old, and the other is under 12 months of age.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence to be translated is:  \n“One of the children is almost three years old, and the other is under 12 months of age.”\n\nA direct, idiomatic rendering into Finnish proceeds component-wise:\n\n- “One of the children” → “Yksi lapsista”  \n- “is almost three years old” → “on melkein kolmevuotias” (the compound adjective kolmevuotias is the conventional way to express age in Finnish)  \n- “and the other” → “ja toinen”  \n- “is under 12 months of age” → “on alle 12 kuukauden ikäinen” (the partitive construction kuukauden ikäinen is the standard collocation for stating age in months)\n\nCombining these yields the fluent translation  \n“Yksi lapsista on melkein kolmevuotias, ja toinen on alle 12 kuukauden ikäinen.”\n\n(The comma before “ja” follows Finnish punctuation norms for compound sentences.)\n\n\\boxed{Yksi lapsista on melkein kolmevuotias, ja toinen alle 12 kk ikäinen.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":171,"output_tokens":216},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001422,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_824","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nIn April 1946, a Supreme Court ruling enabled black citizens in Georgia to cast ballots for the first time during the primary race later that summer.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"V dubnu 1946 umožnilo rozhodnutí Nejvyššího soudu černým občanům v Georgii poprvé hlasovat v předvolební primárce později v tomémž létě.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{V dubnu 1946 umožnilo rozhodnutí Nejvyššího soudu černým občanům v Georgii poprvé hlasovat v předvolební primárce později v tomémž létě.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":62,"output_tokens":139}},"cost":9.146e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_154","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nBank of England to keep interest rates at 0.25%\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence is a concise headline indicating that the Bank of England will maintain its interest rates unchanged at the stated level.  \n\n- “Bank of England” is retained as the proper name in Czech usage.  \n- “to keep … at” is rendered by the future-tense verb “ponechá … na”, which is the conventional headline formulation for an unchanged-rate decision.  \n- “interest rates” translates directly as the plural “úrokové sazby”.  \n- The decimal separator follows Czech typographic convention (comma) and the percent sign is spaced.  \n\nThe resulting headline therefore reads:  \nBank of England ponechá úrokové sazby na 0,25 %  \n\n\\boxed{Bank of England ponechá úrokové sazby na 0,25 %}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":165,"output_tokens":165},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001155,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_23","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nFleet-footed tortoise escaped again from a Japanese zoo\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence to be translated is a concise headline-style statement. Breaking it down word by word yields the following Finnish equivalents:\n\n- “Fleet-footed” → “nopeajalkainen” (a direct, idiomatic compound adjective).  \n- “Tortoise” → “kilpikonna” (the standard general term).  \n- “Escaped” → “karkasi” (the natural verb for an animal escaping from captivity).  \n- “Again” → “taas” (concise and headline-appropriate).  \n- “From a Japanese zoo” → “japanilaisesta eläintarhasta” (the partitive case after the elative preposition “from”).\n\nAssembling these elements while preserving the original word order and headline tone produces the grammatically correct Finnish sentence “Nopeajalkainen kilpikonna karkasi taas japanilaisesta eläintarhasta.”\n\n\\boxed{Nopeajalkainen kilpikonna karkasi taas japanilaisesta eläintarhasta}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":160,"output_tokens":206},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.000135,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_38","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nWhen the active component was purified from the liquid, it turned out to be a byproduct of tryptophan metabolism known as indole-3-lactic acid.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Když byla aktivní složka izolována z kapaliny, ukázalo se, že jde o vedlejší produkt metabolismu tryptofanu známý jako kyselina indol-3-mléčná.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Když byla aktivní složka izolována z kapaliny, ukázalo se, že jde o vedlejší produkt metabolismu tryptofanu známý jako kyselina indol-3-mléčná.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":64,"output_tokens":126}},"cost":8.392e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_171","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe construction of the four wind turbines should cover the energy requirements of around 11,400 households – that equates to around a fifth of the energy requirements of all Viersen households.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence is translated into German by rendering each segment accurately while preserving technical terminology, sentence structure, and natural phrasing:\n\n- “The construction of the four wind turbines” becomes “Der Bau der vier Windkraftanlagen,” the conventional German term for wind turbines in an energy context.  \n- “should cover the energy requirements of around 11,400 households” is rendered as “soll den Energiebedarf von rund 11.400 Haushalten decken,” using the standard verb “decken” for “cover” and the German thousands separator.  \n- The explanatory clause “that equates to around a fifth of the energy requirements of all Viersen households” translates to “das entspricht etwa einem Fünftel des Energiebedarfs aller Viersener Haushalte,” employing the concise adjective “Viersener” and repeating “Energiebedarf” for consistency.\n\nCombining these elements yields a fluent, idiomatic German sentence that retains the original meaning and register.\n\n\\boxed{Der Bau der vier Windkraftanlagen soll den Energiebedarf von rund 11.400 Haushalten decken – das entspricht etwa einem Fünftel des Energiebedarfs aller Viersener Haushalte.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":187,"output_tokens":252},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001634,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_266","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe trade-off from no two-a-days is more one-a-days, the Bruins pushing up the start of camp nearly a week from last season and holding practices during summer school for the first time during Mora's six seasons in Westwood.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Der Verzicht auf zweimalige Trainingseinheiten pro Tag führt zu mehr einmaligen Trainingseinheiten, wobei die Bruins den Beginn des Trainingslagers im Vergleich zur letzten Saison um fast eine Woche vorverlegt und unter Mora in seinen sechs Jahren in Westwood erstmals während der Sommerferien-Schule Trainings abhält.\n\n\\boxed{Der Verzicht auf zweimalige Trainingseinheiten pro Tag führt zu mehr einmaligen Trainingseinheiten, wobei die Bruins den Beginn des Trainingslagers im Vergleich zur letzten Saison um fast eine Woche vorverlegt und unter Mora in seinen sechs Jahren in Westwood erstmals während der Sommerferien-Schule Trainings abhält.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":76,"output_tokens":163}},"cost":0.00010768,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_649","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nConway blasted the network as a \"disgrace\" for comparing the accusations made against Kavanaugh to those directed at Bill Cosby, who was sentenced to three to ten years in Pennsylvania state prison last week.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence involves a political criticism by Conway of a media network, including references to two proper names (Kavanaugh and Cosby) and a factual clause about Cosby’s sentencing.  \n\nA direct, meaning-preserving translation into Gujarati proceeds as follows:  \n- “Conway blasted … as a ‘disgrace’” is rendered by the conventional Gujarati collocation “કોન્વેએ … ‘અપમાન’ ગણાવીને તીખી ટીકા કરી.”  \n- “the network for comparing the accusations made against Kavanaugh to those directed at Bill Cosby” becomes “કેવનૉ વિરુદ્ધ લગાવવામાં આવેલા આરોપોની બિલ કોસ્બી વિરુદ્ધ કરવામાં આવેલા આરોપો સાથે કરેલી સરખામણી બદલ નેટવર્કને.”  \n- The relative clause “who was sentenced to three to ten years in Pennsylvania state prison last week” is attached with the Gujarati participial construction “જેને છેલ્લા અઠવાડિયે પેન્સિલવેનિયા રાજ્ય જેલમાં ત્રણથી દસ વર્ષની સજા ફટકારવામાં આવી હતી.”  \n\nCombining these segments yields a single, grammatically coherent Gujarati sentence that retains the original meaning, register and factual content.\n\n\\boxed{કોન્વેએ કેવનૉ વિરુદ્ધ લગાવેલા આરોપોની બિલ કોસ્બી વિરુદ્ધના આરોપો સાથે કરેલી સરખામણી બદલ નેટવર્કને ‘અપમાન’ ગણાવી તીખી ટીકા કરી, જેને છેલ્લા અઠવાડિયે પેન્સિલવેનિયા રાજ્ય જેલમાં 3–10 વર્ષની સજા ફટકારવામાં આવી હતી.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":194,"output_tokens":542},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0003098,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_682","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nGolf: 'Mollywood' duo on course to smash box office records\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The given text is a concise English headline, which must be rendered in Gujarati while preserving its telegraphic style, proper nouns, and idiomatic phrasing.\n\n- “Golf” is retained as the loan-word ગોલ્ફ (standard transliteration for the sport).  \n- “Mollywood” is likewise transliterated as મોલીવુડ, placed in quotation marks exactly as in the source.  \n- “Duo” is rendered by the natural Gujarati equivalent જોડી.  \n- The collocation “on course to” is idiomatically expressed as …ના માર્ગ પર.  \n- “Smash … records” becomes the compact verb phrase …તોડવા, which is the conventional sports/film-journalism wording in Gujarati.  \n- “Box office records” is kept as the recognizable compound બોક્સ ઓફિસ રેકોર્ડ્સ.\n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent headline  \nગોલ્ફ: ‘મોલીવુડ’ જોડી બોક્સ ઓફિસ રેકોર્ડ્સ તોડવાના માર્ગ પર.\n\n\\boxed{ગોલ્ફ: 'મોલીવુડ' જોડી બોક્સ ઓફિસ રેકોર્ડ્સ તોડવાના માર્ગ પર}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":167,"output_tokens":319},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001929,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-fi-en_67","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nBefore the accident, 23-year-old Suur-Hamari was losing interest in snowboarding.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{Onnettomuuden jälkeen 23-vuotias Suur-Hamari menetti kiinnostuksensa snowboardia kohtaan.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":49,"output_tokens":40}},"cost":3.0370000000000002e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_765","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThis would have allowed it to better blend into its surroundings and evade its enemies, experts say, suggesting it was preyed on by larger dinosaurs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Dies hätte es besser ermöglicht, sich in seine Umgebung einzufügen und seinen Feinden auszuweichen, sagen Experten, was darauf hindeutet, dass es von größeren Dinosauriern gejagt wurde.\n\n\\boxed{Dies hätte es besser ermöglicht, sich in seine Umgebung einzufügen und seinen Feinden auszuweichen, sagen Experten, was darauf hindeutet, dass es von größeren Dinosauriern gejagt wurde.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":57,"output_tokens":103}},"cost":6.921e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_369","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThey used the collateral to buy the Collingwood property where Colin opened the family's first jeans store.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The sentence describes a financial transaction involving collateral (in the sense of loan security) and a subsequent business opening. The accurate German rendering is therefore:\n\nSie nutzten die Sicherheiten, um das Collingwood-Grundstück zu kaufen, wo Colin den ersten Jeansladen der Familie eröffnete.\n\nProper names (“Collingwood”, “Colin”) remain unchanged, “collateral” is rendered by the standard financial term “Sicherheiten”, and the relative clause is kept concise and idiomatic.\n\n\\boxed{Sie nutzten d. Sicherheiten, um d. Collingwood-Grundstück zu kaufen, wo Colin d. ersten Jeansladen d. Familie eröffnete.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":170,"output_tokens":138},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.000103,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_516","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nKendrick Lamar appears to have been the victim of a sizeable leak of unreleased songs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"કેન્ડ્રિક લામાર અનરિલીઝ્ડ ગીતોના મોટા લીકના ભોગ બન્યા હોય તેવું લાગે છે.\n\n\\boxed{કેન્ડ્રિક લામાર અનરિલીઝ્ડ ગીતોના મોટા લીકના ભોગ બન્યા હોય તેવું લાગે છે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":170,"output_tokens":127},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":9.75e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-zh-en_896","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nWiens’ research also revealed that local extinction vary from region to region. Compared to regions with temperate climate, the probability of local extinction of species in tropical regions is doubled.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"韦恩的研究还表明，局部灭绝在不同地区之间存在差异。与温带地区相比，热带地区物种局部灭绝的概率增加了一倍。\n\n\\boxed{韦恩的研究还表明，局部灭绝在不同地区之间存在差异。与温带地区相比，热带地区物种局部灭绝的概率增加了一倍。}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":64,"output_tokens":71}},"cost":5.092e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-de-en_805","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAcross the room, actors Darrius Bradshaw and Nick Rascona, who play Roger Malcom and Barnett Hester, rehearsed their lines.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Auf der anderen Seite des Raumes probten die Schauspieler Darrius Bradshaw und Nick Rascona, die Roger Malcom und Barnett Hester spielen, ihre Texte.\n\n\\boxed{{Auf der anderen Seite des Raumes probten die Schauspieler Darrius Bradshaw und Nick Rascona, die Roger Malcom und Barnett Hester spielen, ihre Texte.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":58,"output_tokens":81}},"cost":5.614e-05,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_239","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nDigital Life and Cheap Connectivity - The connectivity in Jio Phones will be very cheap for the users.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"ડિજિટલ જીવન અને સસ્તું કનેક્ટિવિટી - જીઓ ફોન્સમાં વપરાશકર્તાઓ માટે કનેક્ટિવિટી ખૂબ જ સસ્તી હશે.\n\n\\boxed{ડિજિટલ જીવન અને સસ્તું કનેક્ટિવિટી - જીઓ ફોન્સમાં વપરાશકર્તાઓ માટે કનેક્ટિવિટી ખૂબ જ સસ્તી હશે.}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":172,"output_tokens":159},"model_used":"x-ai/grok-4.3"},"cost":0.0001139,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_505","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\n#selfpub3.0 also means using retailers and other services to distribute our books as widely as possible, in as many formats as possible.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"\\boxed{\\text{#selfpub3.0 એ આપણા પુસ્તકોને શક્ય તેટલા બધા ફોર્મેટમાં અને શક્ય તેટલા વ્યાપક રીતે વિતરણ કરવા માટે રિટેલર્સ અને અન્ય સેવાઓનો ઉપયોગ કરવાનો પણ અર્થ છે.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":58,"output_tokens":216}},"cost":0.00013714,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-cs-en_460","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe Cretaceous was a time when giant theropods, meat-eating dinosaurs that stood on two legs, roamed the Earth.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"Drabínské období bylo dobou, kdy po Zemi bloudili obří teropodi, masožerní dinosauři žijící na dvou nohách.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Drabínské období bylo dobou, kdy po Zemi bloudili obří teropodi, masožerní dinosauři žijící na dvou nohách.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":58,"output_tokens":107}},"