6,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-lt-en_643","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nIt is unofficially stated that only 1% of certificates that certify packaging waste management were issued of the intended recycling tasks”, said Mr. Gentvilas in the press release.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"„Neoficialiai teigiama, kad tik 1 proc. sertifikatų, patvirtinančių pakuotės atliekų tvarkymą, buvo išduota numatytiems perdirbimo uždaviniams“, – pranešime spaudai sakė p. Gentvilas.\n\n\\boxed{{„Neoficialiai teigiama, kad tik 1 proc. sertifikatų, patvirtinančių pakuotės atliekų tvarkymą, buvo išduota numatytiems perdirbimo uždaviniams“, – pranešime spaudai sakė p. Gentvilas.}}","success":true,"token_usage":{"input_tokens":66,"output_tokens":163}},"cost":0.00010638,"accuracy":null},{"global index":"WMT19-gu-en_834","prompt":"Translate the following sentence from English to Gujarati.\n\nAfter the incident, when my friend called me and talked as she cried, I felt as if someone had stabbed me in the heart.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.","prediction":"grok-4-1-fast-reasoning","generated_result":{"generated_answer":"The English sentence can be broken down into the following semantic units for translation:\n\n- “After the incident” → ઘટના પછી  \n- “when my friend called me” (female friend, given the pronoun “she”) → જ્યારે મારી મિત્રે મને ફોન કર્યો  \n- “and talked as she cried” → અને રડતાં રડતાં વાત કરી  \n- “I felt as if someone had stabbed me in the heart” → મને એવું લાગ્યું કે જાણે કોઈએ મારા હૃદયમાં છરો ભોંક્યો હોય  \n\nThese units are then concatenated with the appropriate Gujarati conjunctions and word order to produce a single, natural sentence while preserving the original meaning and emotional tone.\n\nઘટના પછી, જ્યારે મારી મિત્રે મને ફોન કર્યો અને રડતાં રડતાં વાત કરી, ત્યારે મને એવું લાગ્યું કે જાણે કોઈએ 